thub.com","name":"Tine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:56:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Studio] Reject data-object folders in the compare object pickers (#126)\n\n* [Studio] Reject data-object folders in the compare object pickers\n\nBoth ManyToOneRelationInputs only set dataObjectsAllowed, so the studio-ui\ndrop validator (isValidType with an undefined allowed list) and the element\nselector accepted data-object folders. Restrict to object and variant.\n\nFixes #78\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Name the type list after its intent: exclude folders\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ee98c34de1b314281853670e5d2b3cadaad23b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/7ee98c34de1b314281853670e5d2b3cadaad23b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/5cd426a1031f577216777a536efb8167ab0c67d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ee98c34de1b314281853670e5d2b3cadaad23b6\nparent 8e625303d664599d465c8c0fde25779264194bc4\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1790848569 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790848569 +0200\n\n[Studio] Reject data-object folders in the compare object pickers (#126)\n\n* [Studio] Reject data-object folders in the compare object pickers\n\nBoth ManyToOneRelationInputs only set dataObjectsAllowed, so the studio-ui\ndrop validator (isValidType with an undefined allowed list) and the element\nselector accepted data-object folders. Restrict to object and variant.\n\nFixes #78\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Name the type list after its intent: exclude folders\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthro