r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/3b5b9fcc177f4c85587583c8122f8ad25751388d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:07:20Z","email":"42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:07:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Exclude computed field types from merging (#122)\n\n* Exclude computed field types from merging\n\ndataQuality and calculatedValue are computed on the server from the\ntarget''s own data, so offering them as merge rows lets a user copy a\nvalue that is discarded or misleading after the next recalculation.\nDrop them at the row-building gate, the same way unregistered field\ntypes are already dropped. The gate runs per field inside the layout\nrecursion, so nested occurrences (localized fields, bricks) are\ncovered as well.\n\nFixes pimcore/backend-power-tools-bundle#724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c71b54c428c942d73815a99df2bbf186d3f57f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/8c71b54c428c942d73815a99df2bbf186d3f57f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/3b5b9fcc177f4c85587583c8122f8ad25751388d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c71b54c428c942d73815a99df2bbf186d3f57f2\nparent e9f0acc541293402eb7f165d5ff76957cac818b9\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1789992440 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789992440 +0200\n\nExclude computed field types from merging (#122)\n\n* Exclude computed field types from merging\n\ndataQuality and calculatedValue are computed on the server from the\ntarget''s own data, so offering them as merge rows lets a user copy a\nvalue that is discarded or misleading after the next recalculation.\nDrop them at the row-building gate, the same way unregistered field\ntypes are already dropped. The gate runs per field inside the layout\nrecursion, so nested occurrences (localized fields, bricks) are\ncovered as well.\n\nFixes pimcore/backend-power-tools-bundle#724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsR34CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAatYQAE//qJldTG3g98qw9H35xKfr\ndzTrSG/RAdbDb0emvKSGurdsCh7hdK6ZEMjF5k8aGOpA55jPLtEYJ/s4dJ5eQl3A\nNc/NxPkQVRu1bEeJvw1rAbnRdfB8GBMxNikTm9mxotLv1mFXxQqNC2hp11txgQ0E\nzAJNqFswnNCNafdvIhRo1MQcf0j+rq0hFq0MdoUm6mplfR0Gqu2ynCw2q8k65XoV\nws991wBXnxz5cDiMYZ6Tvo9mAGcEsDmNX+k4sjXOSShAkUDXRofVdr8zRXQoVTc/\nzGBwJLAmOy+sBCTx/PThcOn/Vi1l/1RnmAHeQ/jDeg7VZDnIgsWuLssvyWiZ/P55\nFtjKfKxxNbfEEjesZCNWrIDOukgQ8lUHyxOGiF6OD2V+1V24wmpXJ9+0gtJSQJaA\ndzBfo/pnf6PlKiugSCVn4chAbVzKoxb5EhdcNNUNPUx8mI1Xf78aDj9cMzMBLGOZ\nKNLY9VZrIS+x85hmM7FDdrpvKVkJOzs49uaOqi+q2GhkTv7e/MBwQ95Hwk+lc5WC\nGrT4zBeYXQKajUTmxf05oPIe/mnRdn2BHJyeub2AGy/SxBRaPldPfViTG92S43SZ\ne7M7mPQHj4XyrmnorU/aiWhS0yJUrIMDpWLhKbEBTOb6u3wEnCevFHFdp0g1eF7H\nLNvcK3HU8wd7jX2NSeQr\n=ko8Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T12:07:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.