a9e20110930ef3c3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/74aa470e2cdf00cbc3e29fcd4c8352db736af40d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:09:57Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:09:57Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/2026.2'' into 2026.x\n\nBrings the packaged Studio frontend build (#121) forward: the expanded\nsrc/Resources/public/studio/build tree is no longer committed, only\nbuild-dist/build-<id>.zip, which is extracted at cache warmup.\n\nConflict resolution:\n- src/Resources/public/studio/build/**: took 2026.2''s deletion; superseded by\n  the packaged archive. CI regenerates it.\n\nDependencies came forward cleanly: 2026.x had not touched composer.json,\npackage.json or package-lock.json since the merge base, so 2026.2''s bumps apply\nunopposed — studio-ui-bundle ^2026.2.1 (composer) and 2026.2.10 (npm), the\nlatter providing the studio-package-build binary the new package-build script\nneeds. Contrast data-hub-webhooks, where 2026.x had downgraded these and the\nmerge is blocked on it.\n\nThe inherited archive is a 2026.2 build and does NOT contain 2026.x''s frontend\nwork (11 changed JS files), so Studio Frontend Build must repackage on this\ncommit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f92d1db2ee0bb6bd51e6777ce7a6dca61a1a48b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/0f92d1db2ee0bb6bd51e6777ce7a6dca61a1a48b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/74aa470e2cdf00cbc3e29fcd4c8352db736af40d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/object-merger/commit/74aa470e2cdf00cbc3e29fcd4c8352db736af40d","node_id":"C_kwDOBkv9mNoAKDc0YWE0NzBlMmNkZjAwY2JjM2UyOWZjZDRjODM1MmRiNzM2YWY0MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/object-merger/commit/7d3f3ce07540ab6495429bdcaad7da55197d205d","sha":"7d3f3ce07540ab6495429bdcaad7da55197d205d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/7d3f3ce07540ab6495429bdcaad7da55197d205d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/object-merger/commit/6cdc5eb1e59da6edbe93409454390badbd421668","sha":"6cdc5eb1e59da6edbe93409454390badbd421668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/6cdc5eb1e59da6edbe93409454390badbd421668"}],"sha":"74aa470e2cdf00cbc3e29fcd4c8352db736af40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/74aa470e2cdf00cbc3e29fcd4c8352db736af40d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/6cdc5eb1e59da6edbe93409454390badbd421668/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:40:35Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:40:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup) (#121)\n\n* [Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup)\n\nReplaces the committed, expanded src/Resources/public/studio/build/ tree with a\nsingle content-addressed build-dist/build-<id>.zip that studio-ui-bundle''s\nBuildArchiveExtractionTrait reconstructs at cache warmup. 20 committed build\nfiles become one 320 KB archive, removing the per-build file churn and merge\nconflicts the \"Automatic frontend build\" commits used to cause.\n\n- WebpackEntryPointProvider implements BuildArchiveProviderInterface via the\n  shared trait; the interface_exists() guard is dropped since studio-ui-bundle\n  is a hard composer requirement.\n- rsbuild.config.ts derives the build id from source content (getBuildGroupId +\n  pluginWriteBuildId) instead of a random uuid, and the clean-up step keeps the\n  current build dir because studio-package-build picks the lexicographically\n  greatest .build-id on disk. uuid stays in package.json: it is a runtime\n  dependency and part of the Module Federation shared map.\n- CI switches to reusable-studio-frontend-build-packaged.yaml, watching\n  build-dist/** on push. The build-output-path input is dropped, since the\n  default ./build-dist/ is now correct.\n- @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle moves from the April 1.0.0-canary to ^2026.2.10,\n  the stable line shipping ./bundler/build-id, pluginWriteBuildId and the\n  studio-package-build CLI. composer requires ^2026.2.1, the first release\n  shipping the Build/* classes.\n- package-lock.json carries only what that upgrade forces: the version bump, the\n  ranges it raises (dompurify, js-yaml, lodash, react-router/-dom,\n  @remix-run/router) and the removal of an orphaned hoisted node-fetch. npm''s\n  recomputed \"peer\" metadata on 131 unrelated entries was reverted.\n\nSee https://github.com/pimcore/platform-version/issues/247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Document the entry point array types for PHPStan\n\nDropping the interface_exists() guard means the provider is now a top-level\nclass, so PHPStan analyses it where it previously skipped the conditionally\ndeclared one, and reports \"return type has no value type specified in iterable\ntype array\" for both accessors. Both return lists of entry point names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d96a18b49c2ef819b5e56a5cb990cbd719e5563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/7d96a18b49c2ef819b5e56a5cb990cbd719e5563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/6cdc5eb1e59da6edbe93409454390badbd421668","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d96a18b49c2ef819b5e56a5cb990cbd719e5563\nparent bb86b9645d0dbf1833bb9619f9650c39c8be7c5e\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1789753235 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789753235 +0200\n\n[Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup) (#121)\n\n* [Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup)\n\nReplaces the committed, expanded src/Resources/public/studio/build/ tree with a\nsingle content-addressed build-dist/build-<id>.zip that studio-ui-bundle''s\nBuildArchiveExtractionTrait reconstructs at cache warmup. 20 committed build\nfiles become one 320 KB archive, removing the per-build file churn and merge\nconflicts the \"Automatic frontend build\" commits used to cause.\n\n- WebpackEntryPointProvider implements BuildArchiveProviderInterface via the\n  shared trait; the interface_exists() guard is dropped since studio-ui-bundle\n  is a hard composer requirement.\n- rsbuild.config.ts derives the build id from source content (getBuildGroupId +\n  pluginWriteBuildId) instead of a random uuid, and the clean-up step keeps the\n  current build dir because studio-package-build picks the lexicographically\n  greatest .build-id on disk. uuid stays in package.json: it is a runtime\n  dependency and part of the Module Federation shared map.\n- CI switches to reusable-studio-frontend-build-packaged.yaml, watching\n  build-dist/** on push. The build-output-path input is dropped, since the\n  default ./build-dist/ is now correct.\n- @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle moves from the April 1.0.0-canary to ^2026.2.10,\n  the stable line shipping ./bundler/build-id, pluginWriteBuildId and the\n  studio-package-build CLI. composer requires ^2026.2.1, the first release\n  shipping the Build/* classes.\n- package-lock.json carries only what that upgrade forces: the version bump, the\n  ranges it raises (dompurify, js-yaml, lodash, react-router/-dom,\n  @remix-run/router) and the removal of an orphaned hoisted node-fetch. npm''s\n  recomputed \"peer\" metadata on 131 unrelated entries was reverted.\n\nSee https://github.com/pimcore/platform-version/issues/247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Document the entry point array types for PHPStan\n\nDropping the interface_exists() guard means the provider is now a top-level\nclass, so PHPStan analyses it where it previously skipped the conditionally\ndeclared one, and reports \"return type has no value type specified in iterable\ntype array\" for both accessors. Both return lists of entry point names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrXeTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKkwQAEWoZ/QeJ5F9GhVmOUT4M2lu\ndt1Isl+Q7wlcFuYlTQLfLgCmMRtVpB08Ih5lhd3cbVpEWbzbtpgtv36m1UPAqDzS\nnsN/0FWlJkR+QSgMJxQJaMImYhM