ed_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/c9806838f796adf328d9f3f8dfe80d0ca14670f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:20:48Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:20:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align workflow filenames with 2026.x (#117)\n\n* Align workflow filenames with 2026.x; remove dead duplicates\n\nMigration-named new-* workflows take the default branch''s filenames so\nupstream merges map file-to-file; old copies are removed only where\nverifiably dead (retired centralized reference or retired ubuntu-20.04\nrunners). Content is the branch''s own, era-correct version - deliberately\nnot synced from 2026.x (matrix differences).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Align 2025-line workflows with 2026.x (non-matrix families)\n\nPer review of the drift map: .bak files removed, obsolete frontend/npm\nworkflows removed, cla/docs/poeditor/cs-fixer/copilot-setup/stale synced\nto the 2026.x content and filenames, and static analysis gets the uniform\npaths-ignore (assets, assets-customized, doc, install, src/Resources/public,\n**.md). Matrix-bearing workflows keep their era-specific content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Restore trigger scoping (canary-verified pattern)\n\nSame fix as copilot-bundle 0bd53b1: static analysis scoped on push and\npull_request to version branches, matching the 2026.x canonical; other\nsuites scoped on push only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Consistency batch: agreed knobs and trigger polish\n\nPer the consistency audit and the decisions of 2026-09-03: markdown-only\nchanges skip the suites; feature-* leaves the push filters (epics get CI\nvia their PRs); static analysis pull_request aligned to version branches;\nconcurrency uniformly keyed by PR number; setup jobs at 10 minutes with an\nempty-matrix error guard; the studio frontend build no longer re-runs on\nevery PR push (its committed output directory left the pull_request paths\nwhile the push-side stale-merge detection stays exactly as designed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75785e83ffeddb8c16e3ee30828ea3f16d51fc51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/75785e83ffeddb8c16e3ee30828ea3f16d51fc51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/c9806838f796adf328d9f3f8dfe80d0ca14670f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 75785e83ffeddb8c16e3ee30828ea3f16d51fc51\nparent d0ee577b96de184326206e35e4689193281dce0c\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1788452448 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788452448 +0200\n\nAlign workflow filenames with 2026.x (#117)\n\n* Align workflow filenames with 2026.x; remove dead duplicates\n\nMigration-named new-* workflows take the default branch''s filenames so\nupstream merges map file-to-file; old copies are removed only where\nverifiably dead (retired centralized reference or retired ubuntu-20.04\nrunners). Content is the branch''s own, era-correct version - deliberately\nnot synced from 2026.x (matrix differences).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Align 2025-line workflows with 2026.x (non-matrix families)\n\nPer review of the drift map: .bak files removed, obsolete frontend/npm\nworkflows removed, cla/docs/poeditor/cs-fixer/copilot-setup/stale synced\nto the 2026.x content and filenames, and static analysis gets the uniform\npaths-ignore (assets, assets-customized, doc, install, src/Resources/public,\n**.md). Matrix-bearing workflows keep their era-specific content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Restore trigger scoping (canary-verified pattern)\n\nSame fix as copilot-bundle 0bd53b1: static analysis scoped on push and\npull_request to version branches, matching the 2026.x canonical; other\nsuites scoped on push only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Consistency batch: agreed knobs and trigger polish\n\nPer the consistency audit and the decisions of 2026-09-03: markdown-only\nchanges skip the suites; feature-* leaves the push filters (epics get CI\nvia their PRs); static analysis pull_request aligned to version branches;\nconcurrency uniformly keyed by PR number; setup jobs at 10 minutes with an\nempty-matrix error guard; the studio frontend build no longer re-runs on\nevery PR push (its committed output directory left the pull_request paths\nwhile the push-side stale-merge detection stays exactly as designed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmZ5gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn3wQAAJX/XftUeKw1sL0k/Gw9FXV\nACSc6Qm5tdaF2d8cvhZJo2zdkvII6C+eMR2TFQgRrIRwQ4nQ/T6pkhFoE4fuy2ME\nntnPCHrUOsmxmuS35pjyiahl9l0oB0YO2/0GikzVsqHj5VEWkKFvIXFyHl0cEwLz\nrwvjZv+W+xgBK9gE8+faC2R2qfwhUOJEiNHWzYMQSWCmvn2lq7YkzKy/JAUjIYvy\nqWAryRU1oQLzlpGvQW7OSInSozfqCW3icoGkA9GxByCOH1u5AmfyDrIpPdHP2wsL\nfe1ULUUPWKjm6gg6dEBRL/vvyk5a8Kp6YG69o2MRdItx2hUrIvV1slwgOXfJb9xP\nvB9nmUGO1ZFmgDi52awItXCIcYFtAtuXsAKME0AQY95fiIcce6NptIlzIZeM0l6k\nrjWyey736k3k4eIaZKFbpNw9a6iVvCrWyz/Yith8uwRNpLKegoIfOJCj6ITUro23\n7Bs8e81IZA1WhgwMJmW5Nfe8FPsGEpZ1oFwuDOEyZ