ts preselected via autoCompare) keep the Merge button enabled with no unsaved changes, and have save() call onMerged when there is nothing to merge, so an embedded host (the duplicate compare-merge wizard) can advance without a field save. Standalone behaviour is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjrISCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYLgQABG3wZI5ND91iE8H6qfu4orv\n33uVsIOfebvCZlduxF2yJLb5TdKum5U/Rh+vQW24O+IfhM+9tVPAb3d9qUh3jEpn\nkKA4hvSnrVucjy4/E7j/VBzYcY/mNrsoRwcBwic6sxFvOxdI8e8/i3n+QJ7yN23n\n5IKEcOQOjO27wYxtSaXXTxHsKDPh6K7CzL1xg5lmFaRDEBoZvHyRJkHschoq52bp\n6Ni0/d/x/rQSp04qWZKQAh/ShnMVN2HMcTkRaWucvJsqp/T+BpvnGdZTNXtxiP3s\nCWFsV7Xyz8v+cu0zO0N4LTIHg+4lSUtzG7DLj3EuOXCmMte9kO/Rt37tOJWjOhlJ\nBFCZde9pbLFh0aDlgiVScBI+eDhPmQ4x22hpD2HcJjeKKuMcfF5OaNiAlhdHM0QB\nIMisKZigTlqRSlRIUF3vvk/IiJv+InMXNUR7UX8ujMEvLJLTtiCrLqPc3d1uED8M\n4SJnYsu0XBn7ImiE3Ix/k+E2FpLXnboISosU9+/RvxptzXOlow6Yn/lWcxBdY93y\nFflHmCfOOl7BxjvbF+nV+ihl6m0hJ4P50HwIubo/UpAiR9/iZZlyXkq8H/tgYdQf\nucOSZfNlp64tZgV/GSBuIqUZN/xR8Ljjou9hnoOx4dbMJeFXtZXf9N3cxOvOO/tx\np5K9AK8wTqgZ16JvFFTi\n=ucLF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T09:29:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user