contract pattern): mergeObjects()\nopens the merger tab, EmbeddedComponent renders the comparison view without the\nobject-picker form. New props: hideForm on ObjectMergerPage, initialRoles to\nchoose which side a merge saves onto, and an onMerged callback fired after a\nsuccessful save. The window global stays one release, marked deprecated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* design adjustments and getting hide title when used as embedding + translation changes\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Refactor comment in object-merger-api.ts\n\nRemoved redundant comment about not importing from the bundle.\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* use service-ids pattern\n\n* occomodate for mirror view\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad272465a36574e69d1c4e97d348ede3fda4b00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/ad272465a36574e69d1c4e97d348ede3fda4b00a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/25efc056370a00dd39b76084220bea693fae4377","verification":{"payload":"tree ad272465a36574e69d1c4e97d348ede3fda4b00a\nparent 2cab44c773a3968c910331070716a446ed07cfc9\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1787646530 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787646530 +0200\n\n[Studio] Expose a cross-bundle API with an embeddable merger view (#113)\n\n* Expose a cross-bundle API with an embeddable merger view\n\nBinds ''ObjectMerger/Api'' into the shared DI container so other bundles can\nintegrate without a build dependency (mirrored-contract pattern): mergeObjects()\nopens the merger tab, EmbeddedComponent renders the comparison view without the\nobject-picker form. New props: hideForm on ObjectMergerPage, initialRoles to\nchoose which side a merge saves onto, and an onMerged callback fired after a\nsuccessful save. The window global stays one release, marked deprecated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* design adjustments and getting hide title when used as embedding + translation changes\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Refactor comment in object-merger-api.ts\n\nRemoved redundant comment about not importing from the bundle.\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* use service-ids pattern\n\n* occomodate for mirror view\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjVJCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUeUQABDy/gpUfrA6v8sY4WEZmzEE\n1bdSaqgHXb9B0YTKDXKlotSW1ykDaZMR098tWW/jpwPm0XNZeGLzWPZUstg14Px+\nVosD8gaQtXJMsGPzXcTubqjec/r9jkJSMlk3qmUl4PwqkowhFCw1bttriZNOx9aa\nelTPjbjySyQXK9xmsPi3teCK2M82GyLcPO1WCD6U+c6gjHzKKteIHUf0sTIK9hfg\nVjnWgiPGHQb3ZzDRSTAfpXRy5XTHauRU1UcZCCo3tztPKWw1DfyLUBdQW05nHaJ7\norx/hBBKN73iBzKsHZdp3k+kL7Jz1riG2AIT/dPdb7sbdqzrqY7lCmrPO15UlCKo\ngDJhXlDwuZp4iUp2qRR5qRCOgjf/hFwHAXU3KaQq2AvwbR+hTvVnj4X74y8hy5qV\n7OK/8iAaXmaRskRcTPSxwMBQojMyYX7bJeq+e8WLxy4DlX25aZQNuFnfLmW2ec/Z\nPR+z/Eh8jQqqbWKfbdsfu497kb+IlqMRmfA2yv1seV8BmzW26KdZhUgF6CjFDXCa\nMy08+V+L9lV3nap5Y2bRx1V6wO+DdQ/+Ryh+DF9NHOs2FSYo8V5h7gFr9BJuDFHR\nZQwN8VOUWWey3pY9CEbDNd9NRl1t+Kpqfadg3ATw7fm7R/SqzSCiHSQSfg7eZ13I\ngiCHw6GcjiHiivZ7qzvF\n=c0T1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T08:28:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/