","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/object-merger/commit/d281d72c9e8460ddda1fafaa0d44c15c1d52a433","node_id":"C_kwDOBkv9mNoAKGQyODFkNzJjOWU4NDYwZGRkYTFmYWZhYTBkNDRjMTVjMWQ1MmE0MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/object-merger/commit/08e325ab3229e2cf5e17fd1744bcacb552929781","sha":"08e325ab3229e2cf5e17fd1744bcacb552929781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/08e325ab3229e2cf5e17fd1744bcacb552929781"}],"sha":"d281d72c9e8460ddda1fafaa0d44c15c1d52a433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/d281d72c9e8460ddda1fafaa0d44c15c1d52a433"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/commits/08e325ab3229e2cf5e17fd1744bcacb552929781/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:19:35Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:19:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Compare Objects] Show backend error when saving the merged object fails (#114)\n\n* [Compare Objects] Show backend error when saving the merged object fails\n\nSaving the merge target dispatched the data object PATCH and only logged a\nfailure to the console, while the `finally` block marked the target as saved\nregardless of the outcome. A rejected save (e.g. a 500 from\nElementSavingFailedException when the CMF duplicate check refuses the\nmerged data) therefore left no trace in the UI: no message, and the Save\nbutton went back to its disabled \"no unsaved changes\" state as if the merge\nhad been written.\n\nReport the failure through trackError/ApiError so the backend message is\nshown, and only update the last saved versions after the patch resolves.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#270\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f629e00d61c6c4977b347650366675829be12e99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/trees/f629e00d61c6c4977b347650366675829be12e99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/object-merger/git/commits/08e325ab3229e2cf5e17fd1744bcacb552929781","verification":{"payload":"tree f629e00d61c6c4977b347650366675829be12e99\nparent 27786267eb5b3ec31a1beab7568a20e824f5be8f\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1787149175 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787149175 +0200\n\n[Compare Objects] Show backend error when saving the merged object fails (#114)\n\n* [Compare Objects] Show backend error when saving the merged object fails\n\nSaving the merge target dispatched the data object PATCH and only logged a\nfailure to the console, while the `finally` block marked the target as saved\nregardless of the outcome. A rejected save (e.g. a 500 from\nElementSavingFailedException when the CMF duplicate check refuses the\nmerged data) therefore left no trace in the UI: no message, and the Save\nbutton went back to its disabled \"no unsaved changes\" state as if the merge\nhad been written.\n\nReport the failure through trackError/ApiError so the backend message is\nshown, and only update the last saved versions after the patch resolves.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#270\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhbt3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnDkQACzS1cke9mJqPnT78iTyxb8E\nXPf7IimYmVCD6lXwjs5d1j0RdWVAuLKmyLpvePhsET+ca5023YF+X9dqUcuUmAl/\nrclb8RTzKQxKgh1cnppjVd2LhX7yA/e7fFQ5yZg3pNjCNufcFFDg+Xldl8COY0jg\n262X9OtDyWoxBFGzOstNlYWND7ggCPcAk4uJxh+SRA7jWEcANXuijdqC/eTTLVQ6\n5LZGWcc9awTKgb+P9Xbf7rw7PLPERFpnQG/n3axT0YALk/ye2DlrhA9N/l0BiEIY\nQuYSRbtiphJbxluJNtLhgxtrWvbUCjWvwT88FtaYjAxuzjPAY+lzSLXRn8ZHfsts\nldA7b5hAjc+r8yxXhvTV1VvNtFAClrC48X8G0tzIG/ROwarIJxDFeEmfER+Hudgo\nUCriz9wAPX6jvtYhr3rqaHniH/yfDoePGha+njsvQsh5gCnEqrASBgTJQZ98BeE/\nWg/76lyd0ObogtrJXsnyaQOgcG26svfTKO9SusrdMdzrrrXWGm11VojdI1O9onv4\nrH5uWpWuxfz4fMFzv6YG4Od5SBbHtoksOdF4Fz83kg+dSLygsh7DcE8Kpt6yQvB+\nWgvWWhwmQORU1gvriBIxkKXudh8QKt3bal6iL6PrFAin+lL6QkFdVIjiI