vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/commits/774763abfb8191b119673ac9dc0d96b35603cbd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T09:06:40Z","email":"mail@caldis.me","name":"Caldis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T09:06:40Z","email":"mail@caldis.me","name":"Caldis"},"message":"fix(core): align edge geometry and desktop default (1.8.4)\n\nCentralize fit-scale and zoom-bound calculations so edge padding is measured in the same viewport frame for open, rotate, canZoom, and zoom pan. This removes the old epsilon and fallback behavior that could make the computed edge and rendered image diverge for some image sizes and viewport sizes.\n\nChange the desktop preset edge default from 30px to 16px, and sync the playground schema, README, AGENTS, llms.txt, llms-eval, and rebuilt docs bundle so the debug console and public examples report the same default.\n\nBump react-zmage to 1.8.4 and update the React 17/18/19 plus Next.js sandbox tarball refs for verification.","tree":{"sha":"e90a25ba87abdb910e309233bb733da1db83acb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/trees/e90a25ba87abdb910e309233bb733da1db83acb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/commits/774763abfb8191b119673ac9dc0d96b35603cbd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/following{/other_use