},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T14:49:58Z","email":"mail@caldis.me","name":"Caldis"},"message":"feat(core): harden browsing transition and overlay controls (1.8.0)\n\nIsolates imperative browsing instances, cancels stale close timers, and keeps cover visibility stable across rapid open/close/reopen paths. Browsing-in now waits for viewport geometry and follows a single RAF frame source, fixing the first-frame offset and late-transition flashing issues.\n\nAdds animate.slowMotion and controller.layout as public API, with defaults, exported types, docs, playground controls, and llms-eval coverage.\n\nRefreshes the homepage demo around Child''s Dream, switches install docs to npm-first, removes the duplicate repo-root llms.txt, and rebuilds the docs bundle for 1.8.0.","tree":{"sha":"5fabc6fe1e235015de1c6645116ebe453c03a279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/trees/5fabc6fe1e235015de1c6645116ebe453c03a279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/commits/b911b5e906a7bbb2cea31a06a0cb00778ecd3034","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Caldis","id":3529490,"login":"Caldis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Mjk0OTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/subs