48027a91601a0c93a19c39cd7c3b10a3f98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T15:26:48Z","email":"mail@caldis.me","name":"Caldis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T15:26:48Z","email":"mail@caldis.me","name":"Caldis"},"message":"docs(skills): codify release-workflow as a project skill\n\nCaptures the audited release pipeline that pairs with sync-public-docs:\npre-flight verification → version bump (core + 4 sandbox tgz refs in\nlockstep) → build → conventional commit (version in subject) → push →\nhard stop for user-only `npm publish` (OTP-gated) → bare-version tag\n(no `v` prefix) → bilingual GitHub Release (中 → --- → EN).\n\nBakes in repo-specific conventions that are easy to miss:\n- bare-version tags (historical: 1.0.2, 0.8.5, 1.5.0 — never v1.0.2)\n- commit subject ends with `(<X.Y.Z>)`, version in parens\n- bilingual release notes with paired headings\n- semver suggestion + repo-history precedent both presented to user\n  (history shows BREAKING `!` shipped as minor — 1.5.0 carried the\n  closeOnDoubleClick → hideOnDblClick rename)\n- npm publish remains user-only; agent stops after `git push` and waits\n\nAnti-patterns and final checklist included so future sessions can audit\nthemselves before claiming \"release done\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f47952b3a36953be4c700fcfc7ba5d76310796a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/trees/1f47952b3a36953be4c700fcfc7ba5d76310796a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Caldis/react-zmage/git/commits/6f2bd48027a91601a0c93a19c39cd7c3b10a3f98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Caldis/following{/