dobronszki@gmail.com","name":"Janos Dobronszki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T17:38:14Z","email":"dobronszki@gmail.com","name":"Janos Dobronszki"},"message":"proxy: apply frontend redirects before routing\n\nHandle frontend redirects before resolving proxy routes, using longest-prefix\nmatching and preserving path suffixes, query strings, and fragments in redirect\nlocations.\n\nSkip self-redirects so matching backend routes can still serve the request. Add\ncoverage for self-redirect fallback, image cache storage contracts, and update\nconfig save tests for pointer-based patch operations.","tree":{"sha":"a6b6c54ba396ade8a8dfce501621d1bc788ac426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1backend/1backend/git/trees/a6b6c54ba396ade8a8dfce501621d1bc788ac426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1backend/1backend/git/commits/e6901cd01efeaf0d2edf8574bade95cc5bfddd85","verification":{"payload":"tree a6b6c54ba396ade8a8dfce501621d1bc788ac426\nparent 9c946abf1019b7f12c7b8dd4f34064352573882b\nauthor Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1778866694 +0200\ncommitter Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1778866694 +0200\n\nproxy: apply frontend redirects before routing\n\nHandle frontend redirects before resolving proxy routes, using longest-prefix\nmatching and preserving path suffixes, query strings, and fragments in redirect\nlocations.\n\nSkip self-redirects so matching backend routes can still serve the request. Add\ncoverage for self-redirect fallback, image cache storage contracts, and update\nconfig save tests for pointer-based patch operations.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEWfq+Xgbpfqd6MzfQvDpRVu99XisFAmoHWgYACgkQvDpRVu99\nXiv5RA/+P3ifKI8SNR3WuYTmIdWFqX8j+FJasiqgVzkb1QLgUyNalVfNCbB7b/65\nk9N1/xE3PZdPubCkrLfwD+xLU5uKT3uXgW1ssxGyFKxotdNaU3d3jz3vrwa2dFs8\nu6DB18SDdnpDDd6op1K5bp/HIEwZlPc66wU//4SnqhoT0ioTbZIuxHzZqVw0S/Ol\nFi3q6KUA0R54WI6wckDegmL5o7nlxOoNVIRotrCOUeRptVqjIVYL/1EmI43OhREo\n+05otUwK3jjl3/mS