o file-service serves them locally instead of proxying through dead node registrations.\n\nApply immutable image cache headers only on successful transform responses, so file-service failures cannot be cached by Cloudflare/browser as broken images.","tree":{"sha":"8afda7b8cfc7b93dcc88cdfda838f13c1c689730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1backend/1backend/git/trees/8afda7b8cfc7b93dcc88cdfda838f13c1c689730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1backend/1backend/git/commits/a9fb295ccfc7736a32f3f7ce2f5bb49a25afd0b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 8afda7b8cfc7b93dcc88cdfda838f13c1c689730\nparent 23f7f634bb9111b6adc86c38ebccf0b4c8d3f24f\nauthor Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1778779673 +0200\ncommitter Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1778779673 +0200\n\nfile,image: recover stale downloads and avoid caching errors\n\nPromote completed downloads from shared storage when metadata points at a stale node, so file-service serves them locally instead of proxying through dead node registrations.\n\nApply immutable image cache headers only on successful transform responses, so file-service failures cannot be cached by Cloudflare/browser as broken images.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEWfq+Xgbpfqd6MzfQvDpRVu99XisFAmoGBhkACgkQvDpRVu99\nXitj6A//XxDhE6f4e9Cx2vR/iNElTFE2NAF0EtLs5/UZ21vY0Znv28H3Tt7xFuBK\nBspXBdCEwQrEF/RZ4tq2FMO0Ulexm1BqFf+jzUEUWgMbIYgWFTpSEEiixZNP+hzp\nWcMDXvZIz0F/YKkY7VPkXKsBil2aDr2R06r+YPSFUjiJ77qCPiLoRjCISH2cyLcw\nshQHbFGUfAsUkkWgTUixsI9SGUxtgPReyTWWMWdBQqmO4KPIllXfVP3CqDILPBkH\neAazu6tYQQEmSPMlLhbLvWKTqr+EBrrhyTfmIX6tkj83H1PvzLHiyNTfuY1EdGhV\nooNLohGvGzTAlsM+HSw+vQc5158bWyMR6Zw4bqeOatMrRL+A3cd/ZIcnrS3dEJlp\nQEW3sShuznWZG60ErqZ+Kd1ohlLFX5Cno587KhgA5VOAMSWYHdsQ1R/jCsDMtu9r\nq5Z6Neh0pv/5BqkjtKmCcaWprdvtVU+OiPmeEqob3fqjZVFT2prPEtNTaLrnLr2L\ngmV9DFfFMVMHceiYC5g5gPeVjC1N8Dh3wT16aBcNUEBBGN9ORM19JwYm+AES2YTF\nSY3lUgLIgUhdZg1yK6x5Z4LawKq0yp6UcE5xShizu3OeAzNP3JcFkqZdry4QU8X2\nJZYmxyeyYBGHMbMnui9tFyFay5L/