https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/a841e4d49dd58ef9b26e23cc245c25a2a7e7cc8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T22:07:03Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:42:11Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"message":"docs: state the full module and operator scope for the license rule\n\nCopilot noted the README said cp-client-auth while the implementation and rule doc\nalso match cp-client-auth!sofe. The entry now names both, plus aliased imports, the\n! form, and the two things deliberately not reported: ?? fallbacks and a\nsame-named local shadowing the import.\n\nCopilot also reported that if ((hasLicense(...))) escapes detection via a\nParenthesizedExpression wrapper. That is incorrect -- espree does not emit those\nnodes without preserveParens, and both single and doubled parentheses report\ncorrectly when run. No change made.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36ed1ff0b00e7eb4c8bffb90aac1a0a5d76c1c9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/trees/36ed1ff0b00e7eb4c8bffb90aac1a0a5d76c1c9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/commits/a841e4d49dd58ef9b26e23cc245c25a2a7e7cc8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/a841e4d49dd58ef9b26e23cc245c25a2a7e7cc8d","node_id":"C_kwDOBqbUlNoAKGE4NDFlNGQ0OWRkNThlZjliMjZlMjNjYzI0NWMyNWEyYTdlN2NjOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a","sha":"50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a"}],"sha":"a841e4d49dd58ef9b26e23cc245c25a2a7e7cc8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/a841e4d49dd58ef9b26e23cc245c25a2a7e7cc8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T21:47:22Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:42:11Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"message":"fix: stop reporting ?? fallbacks and shadowed hasLicense\n\nTwo false positives found in review, both contradicting the rule''s own promise\nthat reading license state for its value is not reported.\n\nEvery LogicalExpression parent counted as a gate, including ??. But `const\nlicensed = hasLicense(t, l) ?? false` coalesces a value rather than gating a\nfeature, so ?? is now excluded. && and || still report, as documented.\n\nThe callee was matched by name against the set of imported bindings, so a\nparameter or local named hasLicense shadowing the import was reported as though it\nwere the import. The identifier now resolves through scope and only an\nImportBinding counts.\n\nThe doc also now records two known false negatives: a namespace or default import\nused as a member call, and hasLicense?.().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7ac272622c7ebb0efff9cf4651c914699bd101e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/trees/e7ac272622c7ebb0efff9cf4651c914699bd101e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/commits/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a","node_id":"C_kwDOBqbUlNoAKDUwZmRiOWYzNTcwNmM4NWM5NWVjYjEyNjczMmFjM2Q3ZTJhY2JjM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8","sha":"3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8"}],"sha":"50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/50fdb9f35706c85c95ecb126732ac3d7e2acbc3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:07:47Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:42:11Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"message":"feat: add no-license-check-for-feature-gating rule\n\nA license says what the firm bought; a permission says what this user may do.\nGating on hasLicense() shows a feature to everyone at a licensed firm regardless\nof role, and hides it from users granted access another way.\n\nOnly conditional use is reported: the test of an if/ternary/loop, an operand of\n&& or ||, or either behind a !. Reading license state for its value -- seat\ncounts, billing, analytics -- is legitimate and stays silent.\n\nThe rule keys on the import rather than the bare name, including aliases. One app\ndefines its own hasLicense helper with a different signature for analytics, and\nmatching on the name alone would have flagged it.\n\nThere are currently no violations across the Canopy frontend repos: every\nexisting reference is the definition, its tests, the mock, a helper returning the\nvalue, or analytics. This rule is a preventive guard and is expected to stay\nquiet, which the rule doc states explicitly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"239099015357b6e2bf1df76334b4044329f37e6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/trees/239099015357b6e2bf1df76334b4044329f37e6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/commits/3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/3494d7156e25545008417f0445b94f52aa2c7fa8","node_id":"C_kwDOBqbUlNoAKDM0OTRkNzE1NmUyNTU0NTAwODQxN2YwNDQ1Yjk0ZjUyYWEyYzdmYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/a466a678bb6a7eb5d9182de170bff1cb220eaa5f","sha":"a466a678bb6a7eb5d9182de170