tps://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/b30896e0794dc4428bcebd2429bc23106d875bef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:09:16Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:09:16Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"message":"[PS-162] Address PR review feedback\n\n- Walk BinaryExpression inside tw() so string-concat shapes like\n  tw(\"cp-body \" + x) are flagged (+ tests for both operands)\n- Move tests to top-level test/ so they aren''t published to npm, and\n  simplify the test script to `node --test` (no shell glob, works on\n  Windows too)\n- Reword the rule''s error message so \"template literal\" unambiguously\n  means the cp-* token lives outside tw()\n- Preserve pre-5.1.0 deep-import back-compat for\n  eslint-config-canopy/eslint.config.js via an explicit exports entry\n- Fix an outdated comment about the CP_TOKEN_RE boundary rule","tree":{"sha":"6c059bb390285ffe1bdabc401553e7ceab7dab5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/trees/6c059bb390285ffe1bdabc401553e7ceab7dab5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/commits/b30896e0794dc4428bcebd2429bc23106d875bef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/b30896e0794dc4428bcebd2429bc23106d875bef","node_id":"C_kwDOBqbUlNoAKGIzMDg5NmUwNzk0ZGM0NDI4YmNlYmQyNDI5YmMyMzEwNmQ4NzViZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07","sha":"e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07"}],"sha":"b30896e0794dc4428bcebd2429bc23106d875bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/b30896e0794dc4428bcebd2429bc23106d875bef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:51:53Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:51:53Z","email":"mlwill07@gmail.com","name":"Miriam"},"message":"[PS-162] Add canopy ESLint plugin sub-export\n\nShips a `canopy` ESLint plugin via the `eslint-config-canopy/plugin`\nsub-export, with the initial rule `no-cp-class-in-tw`. The rule prevents\nCanopy `cp-*` class tokens from being passed through the Tailwind `tw()`\nhelper, where per-app prefixing would produce broken class names like\n`fo-cp-body`. Ported from a local plugin in forms-ui so every consuming\nrepo gets the same enforcement from one place.\n\nAlso adds a `lint` script that dogfoods the package''s own exported\nconfig, a `test` script using node --test, and an `exports` map so the\nplugin is reachable at `eslint-config-canopy/plugin`.","tree":{"sha":"7e3c07d37ebc473471b35256b0e1c9d097497224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/trees/7e3c07d37ebc473471b35256b0e1c9d097497224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/git/commits/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23111872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlwill07","id":23111872,"login":"mlwill07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTExODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlwill07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07","node_id":"C_kwDOBqbUlNoAKGUxZTM1NTI1OGQ2MzZiNTdiMjFhZGI0N2RhOTdjNTdlM2ZiMTlhMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commit/31b6544d53af9a02b36840d6c4bb7450d9a4750e","sha":"31b6544d53af9a02b36840d6c4bb7450d9a4750e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/31b6544d53af9a02b36840d6c4bb7450d9a4750e"}],"sha":"e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits/e1e355258d636b57b21adb47da97c57e3fb19a07"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/eslint-config-canopy/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=8be3403ea53939fdbe9f06369129021b2d1db5a1&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A20%3A11.826Z"}');
