pack to 1.5.18-alpha.0 and set the default\nstyles.postcss.implementation to the postcss shipped with\n@umijs/bundler-utoopack, so projects no longer need to depend on\npostcss directly for the default pipeline to work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump latest utoopack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c14e68034ccf32465dde01f345275c79a5f6545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/umijs/umi/git/trees/1c14e68034ccf32465dde01f345275c79a5f6545"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/umijs/umi/git/commits/e0cfc8a2f2beccbe4461ec493e8dd9600fd39335","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c14e68034ccf32465dde01f345275c79a5f6545\nparent a91a8451d477f7cd0aac859641043842591554cf\nauthor zoomdong <1344492820@qq.com> 1789441978 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789441978 +0800\n\nfeat(utoopack): pass bundled postcss implementation to utoopack (#13445)\n\n* feat(utoopack): pass bundled postcss implementation to utoopack\n\nBump @utoo/pack to 1.5.18-alpha.0 and set the default\nstyles.postcss.implementation to the postcss shipped with\n@umijs/bundler-utoopack, so projects no longer need to depend on\npostcss directly for the default pipeline to work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump latest utoopack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqLe6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqkcQAEuNS6zb8ZJ9cPIrEFLh58OX\nfhbRg1AeEpaPxf77CQiX9OGhQsP0eEwliH8JwITnTHXoaOr0m1zhzZWS3OwI2tsZ\nfx0P5vWtvJ8bo1DWo77YIGlUDF+NfQH3J6HOrZP9Abbq/2ThNRSX3O1fG1amg7gd\nXvHY6vj8ihy/UPS5lSKQvE9+kJpN7LfgcLurP1pmyWz5/VEnGvR66B66cAIlZqdp\ndUGnE/R6R533nHSNmE6/I9J6+CKHC6vJIbtlTfwY87qzQNL3HoTuKQ0jQVIdakhw\n8j/oY6LT3Nv3Fr12HYVl/ZvgblOrbTCkdHvpXkMK35HcautKxdce8/Zz+8K191wn\nGlgOPDqio88GbHcYZxJGTs+aL2991eThGDbTcRwp8crY4lEzE5y8wWXTpFS0dJ/U\ntQwV9XcCOWlhvBm8YIVJIgOY+aPo05Swsfs/O9x0m+lyImgFdnu7ry