model: worker uses vanilla DOM APIs, not framework APIs\n- Quick starts for vanilla and React host\n- Vite configuration with all plugin options\n- Styling (Tailwind, CSS-in-JS, <style>/<link> elements)\n- Form handling with round-trip diagram and latency notes\n- Data fetching (fetch/WebSocket/cookies in workers)\n- Debugging walkthrough (Chrome DevTools + built-in panel)\n- Testing patterns (unit, integration, e2e)\n- Deployment (Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages)\n- When NOT to use async-dom\n\nMigration Guide (929 lines):\n- Incremental adoption vs full rewrite strategies\n- What won''t work in the worker (exhaustive tables)\n- Communication patterns (host↔worker)\n- Routing, state management, testing\n- Performance validation and common pitfalls\n\nREADME fixes:\n- Fixed misleading opening paragraph\n- Added framework adapter clarification blockquote\n- Added \"When Not to Use\" section\n- Added links to all three guides\n- Added API reference note\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27011105fda0d3014143fb0dbec085bd0be46d7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/27011105fda0d3014143fb0dbec085bd0be46d7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/b8ee4db0de4b136e06795599f884efe00ff8b455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gi