https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/25fa639dc582156937f4277e73addd919a160591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T09:16:53Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T09:16:53Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: tree expand state persistence, destroy cleanup, devtools tests\n\n- Persist tree expand/collapse state across 2-second rebuilds using\n  expandedNodeIds Set; first render uses depth<2 default, subsequent\n  renders respect user''s expand/collapse choices\n- Refresh selectedNodeForSidebar with current tree data after rebuild\n- Cancel pending setTimeout callbacks in destroy() to prevent\n  post-destroy state corruption\n- Reset logPaused and isReplaying in destroy() for clean re-creation\n- Add 14 new devtools tests covering latency dedup, logPaused reset,\n  isReplaying reset, and multi-cycle state consistency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a62f35accba7276379b12f198a9033bd1562bdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/4a62f35accba7276379b12f198a9033bd1562bdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/25fa639dc582156937f4277e73addd919a160591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":