l":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/bd039cb2e1d6e35f653acf07fb6e5338c2942693/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T09:08:21Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T09:08:21Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: critical devtools replay bugs and medium UI issues\n\nCritical replay fixes:\n- Pause scheduler during replay to prevent live mutations racing\n- Clear and rebuild NodeCache on DOM wipe to prevent stale references\n- Restore DOM to latest state on replay exit via full reapply\n- Suppress mutation log capture during replay to prevent pollution\n- Stop replay timer on panel collapse to prevent invisible mutations\n- Use selectedAppId for replay target in multi-app scenarios\n\nMedium devtools fixes:\n- Import mode now pauses live capture (sets logPaused)\n- captureWarning respects logPaused (still increments badge count)\n- Destroyed app fallback calls resetPerAppState()\n- Sparkline dedup prevents duplicate data on manual refresh\n- Log tab skips DOM rebuild when data hasn''t changed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d1d60aa0923b5a49cd4bc701cfc88df295e3c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/8d1d60aa0923b5a49cd4bc701cfc88df295e3c55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/bd039cb2e1d6e35f653acf07fb6e5338c2942693","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":nu