fe8871b799dcfadeb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/146e0b5deabbf56ede5d112190a93c72d8811d1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:00:37Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:00:37Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"refactor: remove dist from git, fix outerHTML/innerHTML, add integration tests\n\n- Gitignore dist/ and remove from tracking (built via prepublishOnly)\n- Implement outerHTML getter with proper class, style, and attribute\n  serialization including void element handling\n- Replace stale innerHTML cache with live tree serialization\n- Sync className setter and setAttribute(\"class\") bidirectionally\n- Fix removeAttribute(\"class\") to clear _classes\n- Sanitize comment nodes against XSS (strip -- sequences)\n- Add escapeHtml/escapeAttr utilities with single-quote defense\n- Move voidElements Set to module scope for performance\n- Add DOM API Compatibility table and streaming limitations to README\n- Add integration tests: full mutation roundtrip, streaming server\n  roundtrip, and binary codec roundtrip (53 new tests)\n- Fix false positive tests in streaming and binary suites\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5c87b634f21063043c909ef419fccf4c8adccd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/d5c87b634f21063043c909ef419fccf4c8adccd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/146e0b5deabbf56ede5d112190a93c72d8811d1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/146e0b5deabbf56ede5d112190a93c72d8811d1d","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDE0NmUwYjVkZWFiYmY1NmVkZTVkMTEyMTkwYTkzYzcyZDg4MTFkMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/3f6d5ff927ff04e89854748dafa31d0837412125","sha":"3f6d5ff927ff04e89854748dafa31d0837412125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3f6d5ff927ff04e89854748dafa31d0837412125"}],"sha":"146e0b5deabbf56ede5d112190a93c72d8811d1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/146e0b5deabbf56ede5d112190a93c72d8811d1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3f6d5ff927ff04e89854748dafa31d0837412125/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T20:08:34Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T20:08:34Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: address all issues from domain expert code reviews\n\nTransport/Streaming:\n- Detect failed clients via readyState check (sendRaw swallows exceptions)\n- Close underlying transport in removeClient (prevent socket/timer leaks)\n- Clear handler array on close() (prevent memory leak)\n- Replace O(n) array shift with O(1) ring buffer in MutationLog\n- Guard flushQueue against closed sockets\n- Stop drain timer on socket error\n\nDOM:\n- textContent/innerHTML setters now cleanup document registrations on\n  removed children (id, listeners, nodeId leaks)\n- _cleanupFromDocument unregisters element id from document._ids map\n- removeEventListener matches by both event name and callback identity\n- cloneNode(true) emits mutations for text/comment children\n- Register body/head/documentElement in _nodeIdToElement\n\nPackage/Docs:\n- Fix README streaming client example (target, addRemoteApp signature, start())\n- Add vite-plugin require field to exports map\n- Update README exports table with new server exports\n- Add CHANGELOG 2.0.0-alpha.2 entry\n- Update CLI help to use scoped package name\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36764b855844d2d78decf7b88b88c83381c8129b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/36764b855844d2d78decf7b88b88c83381c8129b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/3f6d5ff927ff04e89854748dafa31d0837412125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom