-source N-readers architecture (optional, non-default)\n- Add 430+ new tests covering Element, Document, Platform, API Bridge,\n  Server Runner, Main Thread Init, and all streaming components\n- Rename package from async-dom to @lifeart/async-dom with publishConfig\n- Add prepublishOnly script running full CI before publish\n- Document multi-client streaming in README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daa305706a00b17c081d3919b1f7fff1d3d8be76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/daa305706a00b17c081d3919b1f7fff1d3d8be76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/7c2f4cefd85fd5c093e037350a9fa61fe65a1b79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/7c2f4cefd85fd5c093e037350a9fa61fe65a1b79","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDdjMmY0Y2VmZDg1ZmQ1YzA5M2UwMzczNTBhOWZhNjFmZTY1YTFiNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/ace6b35ef34540410941704bf9a5f7e5b93d9668","sha":"ace6b35ef34540410941704bf9a5f7e5b93d9668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/ace6b35ef34540410941704bf9a5f7e5b93d9668"}],"sha":"7c2f4cefd85fd5c093e037350a9fa61fe65a1b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/7c2f4cefd85fd5c093e037350a9fa61fe65a1b79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/ace6b35ef34540410941704bf9a5f7e5b93d9668/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T18:37:00Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T18:37:00Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: address all critical issues from code review\n\nFixes from 3 parallel code reviews:\n\n1. ClientId branded type now used consistently in EventMessage.clientId,\n   clientConnect, and clientDisconnect messages (was plain string)\n2. ThreadManager._uniqueAppId prevents name collisions by appending\n   suffix (-2, -3, etc.) when a name is already taken\n3. VirtualDocument.destroy() now calls collector.flushSync() before\n   clearing state (prevents mutation data loss)\n4. SharedWorker heartbeat uses _awaitingPong flag — interval skips\n   if still waiting, preventing timeout reset on each tick\n5. createServerApp uses dom.destroy() directly, returns { ready, destroy },\n   uses instanceof Promise instead of duck typing\n6. WebSocket server transport has MAX_QUEUE_SIZE (10K) cap to prevent\n   unbounded memory growth under sustained backpressure\n7. ack message now includes appId field for multi-app flow control\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"341a7cee649d86fee4d4726962b3a6894186d5e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/341a7cee649d86fee4d4726962b3a6894186d5e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/ace6b35ef34540410941704bf9a5f7e5b93d9668","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/co