t, createServerApp, named apps\n- Added ./server export to package.json and tsdown.config.ts\n- Updated Package Exports table with server entry\n- Bumped version to 2.0.0-alpha.2\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0685ae0d30407afd4ff1406db5249914884ede74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/0685ae0d30407afd4ff1406db5249914884ede74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/11d20750a0e894579495287a0a06869b8797b1a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/11d20750a0e894579495287a0a06869b8797b1a9","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDExZDIwNzUwYTBlODk0NTc5NDk1Mjg3YTBhMDY4NjliODc5N2IxYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300","sha":"40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300"}],"sha":"11d20750a0e894579495287a0a06869b8797b1a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/11d20750a0e894579495287a0a06869b8797b1a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:40:03Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:40:03Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: PlatformHost, SharedWorker transport, WebSocket server transport\n\nPhase 1 continued + Phase 2 + Phase 3:\n\nPlatformHost abstraction (src/platform.ts):\n- Interface with navigator, installErrorHandlers, onBeforeUnload\n- createWorkerPlatform() for Web Workers (uses self.*)\n- createNodePlatform() for Node.js (uses process.*)\n- detectPlatform() auto-detects environment\n- Replaces all bare self.* references in worker-thread/index.ts\n\nVirtualDocument.destroy():\n- Clears _ids, _nodeIdToElement, _listenerMap, _listenerToElement\n- Resets _listenerCounter, nulls _syncChannel and _defaultView\n\ncreateWorkerDom destroy():\n- Calls doc.destroy(), clearInterval(perfEntriesInterval)\n- Calls platform cleanup functions, transport.close()\n\nSharedWorkerTransport (src/transport/shared-worker-transport.ts):\n- Main thread: wraps MessagePort, heartbeat ping/pong (5s/15s)\n- Worker side: auto-responds to pings, calls port.start()\n- Chrome 122+ close event optimization\n- 23 tests\n\nWebSocketServerTransport (src/transport/ws-server-transport.ts):\n- Wraps generic WebSocketLike interface (not tied to ws library)\n- Backpressure: HIGH_WATER_MARK (1MB), drain polling\n- No reconnection (server-side)\n- 28 tests\n\nServer runner (src/server/runner.ts):\n- createServerApp() wraps createWorkerDom + user app module\n- Error isolation via try/catch\n- Returns { destroy } for cleanup\n\n756 tests passing (51 new).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29ed2261f4aa4202cd73a97d782edaafafc317f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/29ed2261f4aa4202cd73a97d782edaafafc317f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDQwY2ZmZjhjMWIxM2Y0ZWVlZDA2NzNkZGYyMzljNWZkYmVhNmQzMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/9c6f78323737214d963c742d20e5f4fba6bd5c20","sha":"9c6f78323737214d963c742d20e5f4fba6bd5c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/9c6f78323737214d963c742d20e5f4fba6bd5c20"}],"sha":"40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/40cfff8c1b13f4eeed0673ddf239c5fdbea6d300"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/9c6f78323737214d963c742d20e5f4fba6bd5c20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:37:43Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:37:43Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Phase 1 foundation — remote transport support\n\n- Transport: added \"reconnecting\" state, maxMessageSize, bufferedAmount\n- Protocol: added ClientId type, ping/pong/ack messages, clientConnect/\n  clientDisconnect/snapshotComplete system messages, clientId on EventMessage\n- ThreadManager: added createRemoteThread(config) — accepts pre-built\n  Transport without requiring a Worker object\n- AsyncDomInstance: added addRemoteApp(config) for remote transports,\n  refactored addAppInternal to support worker-less apps\n- EventBridge: made attach() idempotent — aborts old controller before\n  re-attaching, prevents duplicate listeners on replay\n- Exports: RemoteAppConfig, RemoteConfig, ClientId, createClientId\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f4ca1209071cd7903301d2e90bf4333e9f36027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/6f4ca1209071cd7903301d2e90bf4333e9f36027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/9c6f78323737214d963c742d20e5f4fba6bd5c20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site