m/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/8f98307f3d5f86f158695729b1b5af3d00e0f71a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:14:50Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:14:50Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"docs: add SharedWorker deep dive to TRANSPORT_PLAN.md\n\n- Multi-app architecture: one VirtualDocument per connecting port\n- Disconnect detection: heartbeat + MessagePort.close event (Chrome 122+)\n- Browser compat: ~50% global, Chrome Android gap (needs dedicated Worker fallback)\n- SAB: works if page is cross-origin isolated, SharedWorker inherits status\n- Performance: identical to dedicated Worker postMessage\n- Error handling: port.onmessageerror, external sharedWorker.onerror\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12d92f48da4e8361533da8d5157032afdae2ba71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/12d92f48da4e8361533da8d5157032afdae2ba71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/8f98307f3d5f86f158695729b1b5af3d00e0f71a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https