lifeart/async-dom/commits/7a4e7c9d24a1ae54982224310dfd868a3fc4b6bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:09:46Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T16:09:46Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"docs: update TRANSPORT_PLAN.md with deep dive findings\n\nAdded detailed findings from PlatformHost audit and MutationLog/replay\ndeep dive:\n\n- Complete global reference inventory (40+ refs across 5 files)\n- Minimal PlatformHost interface (only navigator + error handlers + beforeunload)\n- VirtualDocument.destroy() full cleanup list (9 items)\n- All 23 DomMutation actions classified for replay safety\n- 4 dangerous non-idempotent actions identified\n- Duplicate listener bug in EventBridge.attach() documented\n- toJSON() snapshot gaps (missing listeners, styles, properties)\n- Compaction algorithm with cost estimates (<5ms for 1K nodes)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa743d57bafbc248767b5f41fa7a5298b0a01075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/aa743d57bafbc248767b5f41fa7a5298b0a01075"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/7a4e7c9d24a1ae54982224310dfd868a3fc4b6bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u