i.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/e5c4c5b6ef5de51b2ba38fe083948a13f79d4439/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T14:18:17Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T14:18:17Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: add Vite plugin, React/Vue/Svelte adapters, CLI, and framework demos\n\n- Vite plugin (async-dom/vite-plugin): COOP/COEP headers, __ASYNC_DOM_DEBUG__/__ASYNC_DOM_BINARY__ defines, worker error overlay\n- React adapter (async-dom/react): <AsyncDom> component and useAsyncDom hook with SSR guard, fallback, onReady/onError\n- Vue adapter (async-dom/vue): <AsyncDom> component and useAsyncDom composable with fallback slot, @ready/@error emits\n- Svelte adapter (async-dom/svelte): asyncDom action compatible with Svelte 4+5\n- CLI (npx async-dom init): scaffolds vanilla-ts, react-ts, vue-ts projects\n- ThreadManager reads __ASYNC_DOM_BINARY__ to auto-select BinaryWorkerTransport in production\n- Race condition guards in all adapters (cancelled/destroyed flags for async import)\n- Shared resolveDebugOption utility across adapters\n- React Mandelbrot Explorer demo: interactive fractal with 4,800 pixels computed in worker\n- Vue Game of Life demo: Conway''s simulation with 2,400 cells on a 60x40 grid in worker\n- 34 new tests across 5 test files (668 total tests passing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd5e0e2a0c6ce65a2673e5baeadfa078cfe7182d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/cd5e0e2a0c6c