//api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/7b8b0f818924bf1bd31a0f861202d28f5de0687e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:24:58Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:24:58Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: callMethod mutation, media events, API bridge infrastructure\n\ncallMethod mutation (23rd opcode):\n- play/pause/load/click/scrollIntoView/select/showModal/close/focus/blur\n- Allowlisted method set in renderer (blocks unsafe methods)\n- Binary codec support (opcode 22)\n\nMedia event serialization:\n- currentTime/duration/paused/ended/readyState on HTMLMediaElement events\n- Worker-side _updateMediaState syncs playback state from events\n- currentTime setter emits setProperty mutation\n\nAPI Bridge infrastructure (src/core/api-bridge.ts):\n- Generic Proxy-based bridge: worker→main-thread API proxying\n- Fire-and-forget methods (via callMethod mutation)\n- Sync methods (via SyncChannel blocking read)\n- Property get/set (cached + mutation)\n- Ready for AudioContext, Canvas2D bridges\n\n20 new tests: method emission, renderer allowlist, binary codec, media sync\n\n526 tests, 37 files, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29f734a0d981e5ef4be39c66e34bf82dd9c9f1f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/29f734a0d981e5ef4be39c66e34bf82dd9c9f1f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/7b8b0f818924bf1bd31a0f861202d28f5de0687e","verific