"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/6651d9f3372eb41038aa63b572cd2f5c63f83f56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:08:27Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:08:27Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: scoped localStorage + sessionStorage per worker app\n\nScopedStorage class with full Storage API:\n- getItem/setItem/removeItem/clear/length/key()\n- Per-app key prefix (__async_dom_{appId}_) for isolation\n- localStorage syncs with real browser storage via sync channel\n- sessionStorage is in-memory only (worker lifecycle)\n- Lazy sync channel getter (initialized after init message)\n\nMain thread handler:\n- Storage method calls (getItem/setItem/removeItem/length/key)\n  handled in WindowProperty with allowlist\n\n18 new tests covering round-trips, prefix isolation, sync channel\ninteraction, caching, clear scoping.\n\n506 tests, 36 files, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5b91975148bc8fd92c13de91f3699dc18228db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/a5b91975148bc8fd92c13de91f3699dc18228db6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/6651d9f3372eb41038aa63b572cd2f5c63f83f56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","sig