:1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/89b04485183b0f330b8ece79c3eccfdac0844e97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:00:33Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T09:00:33Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: fix 4 devtools UI gaps — flush button, coalesced log, DebugStats, event/syncRead capture\n\n- Gap 1: Add Flush button in Performance tab scheduler section that\n  calls scheduler.flush() for debugging stalled queues\n- Gap 2: Wire coalescedLog query from worker to main-thread debug data\n  cache; add \"Show coalesced\" toggle in Log tab showing last 50\n  eliminated mutations with dimmed/strikethrough styling\n- Gap 3: Instantiate DebugStats in main-thread, increment\n  mutationsApplied and eventsForwarded, expose via debugStats() on\n  __ASYNC_DOM_DEVTOOLS__; render all 8 fields in Performance tab\n- Gap 4: Add captureEvent/captureSyncRead functions, wire onEvent and\n  onSyncRead debug hooks; show Events and Sync Reads sub-sections in\n  Log tab with formatted entries\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd3fd3b2778eb9d6b05ce3d02edabadcf3a7c308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/cd3fd3b2778eb9d6b05ce3d02edabadcf3a7c308"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/89b04485183b0f330b8ece79c3eccfdac0844e97",