e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/b96d00d1cd74bee8db142f05b765a65efdfe1b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T07:52:53Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T07:52:53Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: review blockers — worker typecheck, DOM id pollution, listener counter\n\nB1: Worker typecheck failure\n- Excluded main-thread-only files (html-sanitizer, node-cache, scheduler)\n  from tsconfig.worker.json\n- Added typecheck:worker to CI script — never regresses again\n\nI5: Renderer polluted DOM with internal numeric IDs\n- Removed node.id = idStr from createNode (was setting id=\"42\" on every element)\n- data-async-dom-id attribute + __asyncDomId expando are sufficient for lookup\n- Tests updated to use renderer.getNode() and data-async-dom-id\n\nC5: document.addEventListener used Date.now() for listener IDs\n- Replaced with monotonic _listenerCounter (matches element pattern)\n\n472 tests, 0 type errors (both configs), 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"179a7fc0021ad2d868604ac3bbab629ee2f24a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/179a7fc0021ad2d868604ac3bbab629ee2f24a0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/b96d00d1cd74bee8db142f05b765a65efdfe1b3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}"