 todo, multi-app, debug\n- Live demo links (with and without devtools)\n- Updated test count (472), added screen.width/height to sync reads table\n- Input sync example in getting started\n- Cleaned up formatting, removed stale test count\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"538fcc8728724f6586286b3a9da7e9cac0cc92e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/538fcc8728724f6586286b3a9da7e9cac0cc92e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/586fa3efb997efe3b9f0339f118dfdddb4685782","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/586fa3efb997efe3b9f0339f118dfdddb4685782","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDU4NmZhM2VmYjk5N2VmZTNiOWYwMzM5ZjExOGRmZGRkYjQ2ODU3ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77","sha":"9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77"}],"sha":"586fa3efb997efe3b9f0339f118dfdddb4685782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/586fa3efb997efe3b9f0339f118dfdddb4685782"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:29:45Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:29:45Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: debug panel review issues + mobile responsive\n\nFixes from code review:\n- Warning messages no longer truncated — show first line as summary,\n  click to expand full stack trace in styled <pre> block\n- Worker errors (WORKER_ERROR, WORKER_UNHANDLED_REJECTION) color-coded red\n- Module-level mutationLog/warningLog/warningBadgeCount reset on destroy()\n  (fixes stale data on HMR re-creation)\n\nMobile responsive:\n- Panel scales to viewport width on screens < 600px\n- Tab bar and font sizes adapt for small screens\n- Collapsed tab remains accessible on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a18bdd72e523b74409dd06332acaa99a0e551e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/9a18bdd72e523b74409dd06332acaa99a0e551e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDk2MTFkNjdhN2FiMTI3NTczODAzNjBhYWY3OGM0OTc1N2QyMGNlNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f","sha":"3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f"}],"sha":"9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/9611d67a7ab12757380360aaf78c49757d20ce77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:20:57Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:20:57Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: rebuild debug panel with virtual DOM tree + worker error reporting\n\nDebug panel now shows the ACTUAL virtual DOM from the worker thread:\n- Tree tab polls worker via debugQuery/debugResult protocol messages\n- Multi-app support: each app''s tree shown in separate section\n- Shows <tag .class #id> format with _nodeId for debugging\n\nWorker error reporting in devtools:\n- Runtime errors (syntax, logical, uncaught) forwarded via error protocol\n- Unhandled promise rejections captured and forwarded\n- Errors shown in Warnings tab with full stack trace + source location\n- WORKER_ERROR and WORKER_UNHANDLED_REJECTION warning codes\n\nEnhanced stats:\n- Per-app worker stats (mutations added/coalesced/flushed)\n- Scheduler stats (pending, frameId, frameTime, isRunning)\n\n472 tests, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c2d4fe12247ee6426d0ef8283600954ed3635fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/0c2d4fe12247ee6426d0ef8283600954ed3635fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDNlZmViYmYwN2Y3MWUzYmQ5NjM2ZWQzNzVjY2U4ODM4M2M1NTZjOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81","sha":"486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81"}],"sha":"3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3efebbf07f71e3bd9636ed375cce88383c556c8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:08:41Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:08:41Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: in-page debug panel + demo toggle\n\nIn-page DevTools panel (no Chrome extension needed):\n- Shadow DOM isolated overlay in bottom-right corner\n- 4 tabs: Tree (virtual DOM), Performance (scheduler stats),\n  Log (mutation stream), Warnings (always-on bug alerts)\n- Auto-injected when debug.exposeDevtools is true\n- Polls only when expanded (zero CPU when collapsed)\n- Collapsible \"async-dom\" tab, dark theme, < 5KB\n\nDemo page toggle:\n- \"DevTools\" button in header bar\n- Adds/removes ?debug query param, reloads page\n- Panel appears at https://lifeart.github.io/async-dom/?debug\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"258d56beeb21cd4d77acfba2e55323c9ce110845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/258d56beeb21cd4d77acfba2e55323c9ce110845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDQ4NmE5OGVmZDA4NWE2NTc0N2UwN2ZjZWYyNzlhODE0ZjFhM2ZlODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0","sha":"2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0"}],"sha":"486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/486a98efd085a65747e07fcef279a814f1a3fe81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:00:28Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:00:28Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Chrome DevTools extension for async-dom\n\nChrome extension with DevTools panel for debugging async-dom apps:\n\n- Tree View: virtual DOM inspector, click to highlight real DOM element\n- Performance: real-time scheduler stats, queue depth, mutations/frame\n- Messages: mutation batch log with filtering by action type\n- Warnings: collected async-dom warnings and errors\n\nUses existing __ASYNC_DOM_DEVTOOLS__ API — no source changes needed.\nLoad as unpacked extension from chrome-extension/ directory.\n\nFiles: manifest.json, devtools.html/js, panel.html/js/css, content-script.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5aee3d36d133e1c8bb3f757fef6b5526f729424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/a5aee3d36d133e1c8bb3f757fef6b5526f729424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDJmYTljMjE1NGQ5MzgyMGM0N2UwOWJlNTQ5ODRhOWVmODhiNmQxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b","sha":"29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b"}],"sha":"2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/2fa9c2154d93820c47e09be54984a9ef88b6d1a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:56:45Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:56:45Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: proper debug API — always-on warnings for bugs, scheduler health monitoring\n\nBased on real debugging pain points from this session:\n\nAlways-on warnings (never silent bugs):\n- Missing node in renderer → console.warn with nodeId and action\n- Queue overflow > 10K → console.warn with possible causes\n- Scheduler not ticking after 1s → console.warn (hidden tab detection)\n- Worker error → console.error\n- Worker disconnect → console.warn\n\nScheduler health monitoring:\n- getStats() public method (pending, frameId, lastFrameTimeMs, isRunning)\n- Health check timer (warns if tick() doesn''t fire within 1 second)\n- Queue overflow tracking with auto-reset\n\nEnhanced __ASYNC_DOM_DEVTOOLS__:\n- scheduler.stats() and scheduler.flush() for live debugging\n- renderers() shows per-app root info\n- Worker-side: flush() for manual mutation drain\n\nStartup diagnostics:\n- console.debug on init with app count and config summary\n- console.debug on transport ready\n\n472 tests, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9280c2769df61d25400485bde7ddcde6c63d223d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/9280c2769df61d25400485bde7ddcde6c63d223d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDI5NDI2ZDQ2NTk5N2NjNmRiYTMwYjdmNWZhZTkyNmZhYzFhNTU0NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb","sha":"48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb"}],"sha":"29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/29426d465997cc6dba30b7f5fae926fac1a5546b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:50:19Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:50:19Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: scheduler falls back to setTimeout when tab is hidden (rAF never fires)\n\nRoot cause: requestAnimationFrame callbacks don''t fire when a browser\ntab is hidden (document.hidden === true). The scheduler relied entirely\non rAF, so if the page loaded in a background tab, no mutations were\never processed — the queue grew indefinitely.\n\nFix: scheduleFrame() checks document.hidden and uses setTimeout as\na fallback. This also fixes the initial render when the page loads\nin a non-focused tab (common with GitHub Pages deploys).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3c1abcdd790336eb1497ae1234f53925cb66fa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/c3c1abcdd790336eb1497ae1234f53925cb66fa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDQ4MTY3YzVlMDkxNWVhYzBlODQyN2YyMDQ2ZjE3NDUxMWJhZDQ2ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/3589bae5c26b2546e445d85e1b4b957b489544fc","sha":"3589bae5c26b2546e445d85e1b4b957b489544fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3589bae5c26b2546e445d85e1b4b957b489544fc"}],"sha":"48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/48167c5e0915eac0e8427f2046f174511bad46fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/3589bae5c26b2546e445d85e1b4b957b489544fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:35:26Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:35:26Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: always seed structural nodes in NodeCache (fixes demo not rendering)\n\nThe default path (config.worker without mountPoint) was not seeding\nBODY_NODE_ID/HEAD_NODE_ID/HTML_NODE_ID in the per-app NodeCache.\nWorker mutations targeting body were silently dropped because the\nrenderer couldn''t find the parent node.\n\nNow uses appRenderer.getRoot() to always seed, regardless of whether\na custom mountPoint/shadow root was provided.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7c80008f6dd5871725d5cd29a758a212fea4562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/e7c80008f6dd5871725d5cd29a758a212fea4562"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/3589ba