hildren vs childNodes table, childElementCount, firstElementChild, lastElementChild\n- element.id returns HTML attribute (not internal _nodeId)\n- addEventListener options (once, capture, passive)\n- Binary codec: 22 opcodes, bounds checking, string dedup\n- Scheduler: cursor-based O(n) dequeue\n- Updated bundle sizes, test count (503), Quick Start example\n- Document API table: createEvent, createTreeWalker, createRange, activeElement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7478f54c2c8a816d286c1b702b30a111d6bd6818","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/7478f54c2c8a816d286c1b702b30a111d6bd6818"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/5545ead98acdb017e9746af7298d55b7985d9c06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/5545ead98acdb017e9746af7298d55b7985d9c06","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDU1NDVlYWQ5OGFjZGIwMTdlOTc0NmFmNzI5OGQ1NWI3OTg1ZDljMD