operty/setProperty/cssText: 4 new tests\n- element.id returns HTML attribute, not internal _nodeId\n- Binary decoder throws on truncated buffer\n- Scheduler processes 500-item queue without data loss\n\n503 tests across 34 files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13af4cfd0a17b9471a8a339bbea034fceae7fd8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/13af4cfd0a17b9471a8a339bbea034fceae7fd8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/bb3e33904616c51ceab6a78b96679b76b351f816","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/bb3e33904616c51ceab6a78b96679b76b351f816","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKGJiM2UzMzkwNDYxNmM1MWNlYWI2YTc4Yjk2Njc5Yjc2YjM1MWY4MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52","sha":"f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52"}],"sha":"bb3e33904616c51ceab6a78b96679b76b351f816","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/bb3e33904616c51ceab6a78b96679b76b351f816"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T23:12:19Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T23:12:19Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Sprint 6 — all P0 blockers fixed for 1.0 readiness\n\nDOM API correctness:\n- children now returns elements-only (childNodes has all nodes)\n- Added childElementCount, firstElementChild, lastElementChild\n- element.id returns HTML attribute (internal _nodeId for protocol)\n- addEventListener accepts options { once, capture, passive }\n- style.getPropertyValue(), removeProperty(), setProperty(), cssText\n\nPerformance:\n- Scheduler uses cursor-based dequeue (was O(n²) shift, now O(n))\n\nSafety:\n- Binary codec decoder has bounds checking (no uncaught RangeError)\n\nPackage:\n- LICENSE included in npm package files\n\n494 tests, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors, clean build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"391eade03e96c42f698a27b4b3f385f986389e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/391eade03e96c42f698a27b4b3f385f986389e87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKGY3OWE3N2RjYWQ1YWUzZTJjNDc1NGUzMTc3Njk2M2M0MGI5NGRkNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f","sha":"acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f"}],"sha":"f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/f79a77dcad5ae3e2c4754e31776963c40b94dd52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T22:43:03Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T22:43:03Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Sprint 5 — binary mutation codec + string dedup store (10x wire improvement)\n\nAll 4 @ampproject/worker-dom techniques now adopted:\n\n1. Numeric Node IDs (Sprint 4) — NodeId = branded number\n2. String Dedup Store (NEW) — bidirectional string↔uint16 index mapping\n   - Strings sent once, referenced by index thereafter\n   - Worker and main thread maintain synchronized stores\n3. Binary Mutation Codec (NEW) — DataView-based encoder/decoder\n   - uint8 opcodes for 22 mutation types\n   - uint32 for node IDs (supports >65K nodes)\n   - uint16 for string indices\n   - Growable buffer with ensureCapacity\n4. Expando __asyncDomId (Sprint 2) — fast reverse lookup\n\nWire format: binary mutations + string table preamble, transferred\nzero-copy via postMessage transfer list. ~10x smaller than JSON.\n\nNew files:\n- src/core/string-store.ts — StringStore class\n- src/core/binary-codec.ts — BinaryMutationEncoder/Decoder + MutOp enum\n\n494 tests across 34 files, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c761f525295c914dabe206a8841df9b8ceded330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/c761f525295c914dabe206a8841df9b8ceded330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/acf64e8a503009756ebaa0eb041ae1e74e3c6d7f","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKGFjZjY0ZThhNTAzMDA5NzU2ZWJhYTBlYjA0MWFlMW