tarts at 10 (reserved 1-9 for structural)\n- Faster Map lookups, smaller wire format, prerequisite for binary encoding\n- All 18 test files migrated to createNodeId() (no-arg)\n\nSprint 4 Polish:\n- window.screen sync via dotted property path support in sync channel\n- Dotted path traversal in WindowProperty handler (e.g., \"screen.width\")\n\nBiome lint:\n- Zero errors across 60 files\n- Fixed noAssignInExpressions in selector-engine\n- Fixed noNonNullAssertion in scheduler, ws-transport, mutation-collector\n- Added biome-ignore for observer stub constructors\n\n441 tests, 32 files, 0 type errors, 0 lint errors, clean build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d71f16f4aa82c386c7d45eb2231928619af84fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/7d71f16f4aa82c386c7d45eb2231928619af84fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/de9c07f65fc0aae5560c0c27c9c69775ba301fae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_