framework compatibility:\n- namespaceURI on elements, createElementNS stores namespace\n- isConnected getter (walks parent chain to documentElement)\n- getRootNode(), hasChildNodes(), normalize() stub\n- nextElementSibling / previousElementSibling\n- replaceChild(newChild, oldChild)\n- dispatchEvent on VirtualElement (synthetic events)\n- getAttributeNS / setAttributeNS / removeAttributeNS\n- Node type constants (ELEMENT_NODE, TEXT_NODE, etc.)\n- createEvent + initEvent (legacy API for React)\n- createRange + createContextualFragment (stub for Vue)\n- createTreeWalker (for React hydration)\n- document.activeElement (stub)\n- Additional on* setters: oninput, onfocus, onblur, onsubmit\n\nReview fixes (Sprint 2):\n- Fix text/comment node ID leak in _ids map during subtree cleanup\n- Fix EventBridge descendant listener leak on subtree removal\n  (renderer now walks subtree calling onNodeRemoved for all children)\n\n441 tests across 32 files, zero type errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e9c465c0f1c18a361b02ff5827a02c6d74e1f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/1e9c465c0f1c18a361b02ff5827a02c6d74e1f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/2f0cdbcc01eaadfe3c822b480a382e7c33443b81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/2f0cdbcc01eaadfe3c822b480a382e7c33443b81","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDJmMGNkYmNjMDFlYWFkZmUzYzgyMmI0ODBhMzgyZTdjMzM0NDNiODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b","sha":"6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b"}],"sha":"2f0cdbcc01eaadfe3c822b480a382e7c33443b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/2f0cdbcc01eaadfe3c822b480a382e7c33443b81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:55:56Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:55:56Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Sprint 2 — memory leaks, O(1) dispatch, on* handlers, lint fixes\n\nSprint 2 (Performance + Memory):\n- Fix _ids map memory leak: unregisterElement on remove, recursive cleanup\n- Fix _eventListeners leak: clear on element removal\n- O(1) event dispatch via _listenerToElement Map (was O(n) scan)\n- on* property setters now replace instead of accumulating listeners\n- Expando __asyncDomId for fast reverse lookup (keeps data-attr for debugging)\n- visibilitychange listener properly removed on destroy()\n- engines: node >= 18 in package.json\n\nLint/Format:\n- Biome auto-format applied across all files\n- Fix unused imports/variables\n- Fix observer constructors after biome unsafe fix\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78cfe3b05b74805d1ba5247debb7b25fe0640032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/78cfe3b05b74805d1ba5247debb7b25fe0640032"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDZkNjZjYmZiNGNmN2Y5Njg5ZTc2NGZiMGMzZWIzMjE5N2Q4MDRlM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1","sha":"0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1"}],"sha":"6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/6d66cbfb4cf7f9689e764fb0c3eb32197d804e3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:47:06Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:47:06Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"fix: demo page — add coi-serviceworker for SharedArrayBuffer on GitHub Pages\n\nGitHub Pages doesn''t support custom headers, so COOP/COEP headers\nneeded for SharedArrayBuffer must be injected via a service worker.\n\n- Add coi-serviceworker.js to examples/vanilla/public/\n- Add script tag to index.html to register it\n- Remove non-functional _headers file from deploy workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"680531267504f08c666a63adea2081173887c7e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/680531267504f08c666a63adea2081173887c7e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKDAwMTRmYjU5OGExMWE1ODhmNjg5ZTUxNzIzN2RkZjZlNDQ3MTUwZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d","sha":"a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d"}],"sha":"0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/0014fb598a11a588f689e517237ddf6e447150f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:37:55Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T21:37:55Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Sprint 1 blockers, debugging DX, perf optimizations, shadow DOM & isolation\n\nSprint 1 Blockers:\n- Fix .d.ts hashed filenames (hash: false in tsdown)\n- HTML sanitizer for innerHTML/insertAdjacentHTML (strips script, iframe,\n  style, on* attrs, javascript:/data: URIs)\n- setAttribute filtering (blocks on* attrs, dangerous URIs)\n- Property allowlist for setProperty (blocks innerHTML, __proto__, etc.)\n- Worker crash/disconnect handling (onError/onClose, auto-cleanup)\n- Error forwarding from worker (self.onerror, self.onunhandledrejection)\n- Multiple onMessage handlers (fixes silent overwrite bug)\n- Handler exception isolation (try/catch per handler)\n\nPer-App Isolation:\n- Per-app DomRenderer + NodeCache (structural isolation)\n- Shadow DOM support (CSS isolation via shadow roots)\n- Renderer permissions (allowHeadAppend, allowBodyAppend, etc.)\n- Scheduler fairness for multi-app (per-app budget caps)\n- Mount point enforcement\n\nPerformance:\n- Mutation coalescing (last-write-wins dedup, create+remove elimination)\n- Binary transport (Transferable ArrayBuffer, zero-copy)\n- querySelector early termination\n- Polling exponential backoff\n- Removed getElementById fallback, removed appendChild body fallback\n\nDebugging DX:\n- Debug module with DebugOptions, WarningCode, DebugStats\n- Warning diagnostics on silent failures (missing nodes, timeouts)\n- document.toJSON() virtual DOM tree snapshot\n- __ASYNC_DOM_DEVTOOLS__ global (tree inspection, node lookup, stats)\n- MutationCollector stats (added/coalesced/flushed)\n- GitHub Pages deploy workflow for demo\n\n400 tests across 31 files, zero type errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"769a4681f680e4cdf73f2a54ff4e2683edc95b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/769a4681f680e4cdf73f2a54ff4e2683edc95b6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/commits/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d","node_id":"C_kwDOBuBButoAKGE3Yjg0MTMxNjcyN2ViMDQzMGU3YWRkNWI4MjRhY2RkODZkOTYyMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart/async-dom/commit/1a23f42f8eb59cbc9a549eec68e2eed88290a270","sha":"1a23f42f8eb59cbc9a549eec68e2eed88290a270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/1a23f42f8eb59cbc9a549eec68e2eed88290a270"}],"sha":"a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/a7b841316727eb0430e7add5b824acdd86d9620d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1360552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lifeart","id":1360552,"login":"lifeart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjA1NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lifeart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/commits/1a23f42f8eb59cbc9a549eec68e2eed88290a270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:21:06Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:21:06Z","email":"lifeart92@gmail.com","name":"Alex Kanunnikov"},"message":"feat: Phase 2 — sync reads, DOM API completeness, framework compatibility & isolation\n\nComplete TypeScript rewrite with comprehensive DOM API surface for\nReact/Preact/Vue compatibility in Web Workers:\n\n- Synchronous DOM reads via SharedArrayBuffer + Atomics (Partytown-inspired):\n  getBoundingClientRect, getComputedStyle, layout getters, window dimensions\n- CSS selector engine: querySelector/All, matches, closest, getElementsBy*\n- Event bubbling with stopPropagation/stopImmediatePropagation, VirtualEvent\n- Input state sync (value/checked round-trip with main thread)\n- Modern DOM methods: append, prepend, replaceWith, before, after, dataset\n- Observer stubs (MutationObserver, ResizeObserver, IntersectionObserver)\n- Per-app isolation: separate DomRenderer+NodeCache per worker app\n- Shadow DOM support for CSS isolation (shadow root per app)\n- Renderer permissions (allowHeadAppend, allowBodyAppend, allowNavigation)\n- Scheduler fairness for multi-app deployments\n- 308 tests across 27 files, zero type errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4100c6ef0299f39d0256ba4e2713559468beb3d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lifeart/async-dom/git/trees/4100c6ef0299