o-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest, fix open dependabot alerts\n\nConsolidates dependabot PRs #228, #229, #230, #232, #234, #235 into a single\nupdate of all minor/patch packages (51 packages).\n\nSecurity: raises override floors in pnpm-workspace.yaml so patched versions of\nvulnerable transitive deps resolve (alerts #383, #384, #385, #387, #388, #389, #390):\n- adm-zip >= 0.6.1\n- hono >= 4.13.5\n- js-yaml@3 >= 3.15.2, js-yaml@4 >= 4.3.2\n- smol-toml >= 1.7.1\n\nMajor bumps intentionally skipped: typescript 7 (nx incompatibility),\nvitest/@vitest 5, dotenv 18, mermaid 12.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"457a63c0c0fac72c6a80be1430c0eabf09869046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/457a63c0c0fac72c6a80be1430c0eabf09869046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/295909a9ea600448426d2ebf256ffd50099c16fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 457a63c0c0fac72c6a80be1430c0eabf09869046\nparent d42e0309cf0b4abb573850dbac79b50fd62cbd23\nauthor chrisjwalk <8442112+chrisjwalk@users.noreply.github.com> 1789924628 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789924628 -0400\n\nchore: update all packages to latest, fix open dependabot alerts (#237)\n\n* ci: skip SWA deploy steps for dependabot PRs\n\nDependabot runs don''t get Actions-scoped secrets (AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN),\nso the deploy and close steps fail and block PRs from merging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest, fix open dependabot alerts\n\nConsolidates dependabot PRs #228, #229, #230, #232, #234, #235 into a single\nupdate of all minor/patch packages (51 packages).\n\nSecurity: raises override floors 