hrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/d42e0309cf0b4abb573850dbac79b50fd62cbd23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:20:27Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:20:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: adopt official @nx/dotnet plugin, retire custom dotnet-builder (#233)\n\n* feat: adopt official @nx/dotnet plugin, retire custom dotnet-builder\n\n- @nx/dotnet infers Api and Api.Test from their csproj files, with cached\n  build/restore targets and an Api.Test -> Api dependency edge in the graph\n- Api publish target preserves the deploy layout: Release output to dist/\n- Api.Test test target keeps dotnet test + coverage merge (coverage.xml)\n- removed tools/builders/dotnet-builder executors and the postinstall compile\n- removed the pre-Nx apps/api/package.json stub (it was being inferred as a\n  phantom \"angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter\" project)\n- updated npm scripts, playwright webServer, create-mfe/update-packages\n  skills, and the testing recipe\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api): explain why the publish output path is cwd-relative\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afed9d70f804cc538df46ad447ae564c11bac6f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/afed9d70f804cc538df46ad447ae564c11bac6f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/d42e0309cf0b4abb573850dbac79b50fd62cbd23","verification":{"payload":"tree afed9d70f804cc538df46ad447ae564c11bac6f2\nparent 8b68df23d73ba1cdae7febfb8beb24724e20af84\nauthor chr