rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/8b68df23d73ba1cdae7febfb8beb24724e20af84","node_id":"C_kwDOBucjadoAKDhiNjhkZjIzZDczYmExY2RhZTdmZWJmYjhiZWIyNDcyNGUyMGFmODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed","sha":"e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed"}],"sha":"8b68df23d73ba1cdae7febfb8beb24724e20af84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/8b68df23d73ba1cdae7febfb8beb24724e20af84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:56:50Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:56:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: drop deprecated Angular packages, migrate vite targets off deprecated executors, update packages (#223)\n\n* chore: drop deprecated Angular pkgs, migrate vite targets, update packages (closes #222)\n\n- Remove @angular/animations and @angular/platform-browser-dynamic (deprecated\n  in Angular 22, unused by any code) from deps, pnpm-workspace allowedVersions,\n  and MFE shared-singleton entries in both vite configs.\n- Replace @analogjs/platform:vite / :vite-dev-server executors (re-exports of\n  the @nx/vite executors deprecated in Nx 24) with command-style vite targets\n  mirroring @nx/vite/plugin''s inferred targets. Target names, configurations,\n  dependsOn wiring, and cache outputs are preserved; Playwright/CI unchanged.\n  counter-remote gains prerender.routes: [] so nitro doesn''t force an SSR\n  environment build (no main.server.ts).\n- Rename both vite configs to .mts (native config-loader readiness) and use\n  import.meta.dirname instead of __dirname.\n- Add vite-tsconfig-paths so the dev-server dependency scan resolves @myorg/*\n  workspace paths (previously handled by the nx dev-server executor).\n- Update packages: postcss 8.5.26, @ngrx/operators 22.0.0, @ngrx/signals\n  22.0.0, jsdom 30.0.1, esbuild 0.28.2. TypeScript stays at 6.0.3 (TS 7 breaks\n  nx 23.1.1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: exclude workspace libs from optimizeDeps instead of vite-tsconfig-paths\n\nVite 8 resolves tsconfig paths natively via resolve.tsconfigPaths (already\nenabled), and warns when the vite-tsconfig-paths plugin is present. The only\ngap was the esbuild dependency scan, which doesn''t use the native resolution.\nExclude the @myorg/* source libs from optimizeDeps instead — they are source\ncode, not deps, so prebundling them was never desirable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: restore workspace-root cwd for vite targets, fix tailwind sources and share pins\n\nThree regressions from the command-target migration, all rooted in the vite\nprocess no longer running from the workspace root:\n\n- Analog plugins resolve workspaceRoot/fileReplacements/content paths against\n  process.cwd(), and the content plugin joins cwd-relative glob results with\n  workspaceRoot — both break when cwd is the app dir (preview build failed on\n  CI with UNRESOLVED_ENTRY / UNLOADABLE_DEPENDENCY). Run vite with cwd = ''.''\n  and pass the config explicitly via --config, restoring the old executor''s\n  cwd semantics; keep an explicit workspaceRoot in the analog() options.\n- Tailwind v4 auto-detection is cwd-based, so libs/** and docs/** classes\n  (e.g. the navbar''s md: variants) stopped being generated. Add explicit\n  @source directives for libs and docs.\n- Bump the MF share pins (angVer/cdkMatVer) from ~22.0.x to ~22.1.4 so they\n  satisfy the installed packages and stop the federation runtime\n  version-mismatch warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9391b5f6f7ae19bdf4de5e52b9da74e02b1210e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/9391b5f6f7ae19bdf4de5e52b9da74e02b1210e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 9391b5f6f7ae19bdf4de5e52b9da74e02b1210e5\nparent 75796ac52981484443336e21ae5bfafaf99b42e5\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1788123410 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788123410 -0400\n\nchore: drop deprecated Angular packages, migrate vite targets off deprecated executors, update packages (#223)\n\n* chore: drop deprecated Angular pkgs, migrate vite targets, update packages (closes #222)\n\n- Remove @angular/animations and @angular/platform-browser-dynamic (deprecated\n  in Angular 22, unused by any code) from deps, pnpm-workspace allowedVersions,\n  and MFE shared-singleton entries in both vite configs.\n- Replace @analogjs/platform:vite / :vite-dev-server executors (re-exports of\n  the @nx/vite executors deprecated in Nx 24) with command-style vite targets\n  mirroring @nx/vite/plugin''s inferred targets. Target names, configurations,\n  dependsOn wiring, and cache outputs are preserved; Playwright/CI unchanged.\n  counter-remote gains prerender.routes: [] so nitro doesn''t force an SSR\n  environment build (no main.server.ts).\n- Rename both vite configs to .mts (native config-loader readiness) and use\n  import.meta.dirname instead of __dirname.\n- Add vite-tsconfig-paths so the dev-server dependency scan resolves @myorg/*\n  workspace paths (previously handled by the nx dev-server executor).\n- Update packages: postcss 8.5.26, @ngrx/operators 22.0.0, @ngrx/signals\n  22.0.0, jsdom 30.0.1, esbuild 0.28.2. TypeScript stays at 6.0.3 (TS 7 breaks\n  nx 23.1.1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: exclude workspace libs from optimizeDeps instead of vite-tsconfig-paths\n\nVite 8 resolves tsconfig paths natively via resolve.tsconfigPaths (already\nenabled), and warns when the vite-tsconfig-paths plugin is present. The only\ngap was the esbuild dependency scan, which doesn''t use the native resolution.\nExclude the @myorg/* source libs from optimizeDeps instead — they are source\ncode, not deps, so prebundling them was never desirable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: restore workspace-root cwd for vite targets, fix tailwind sources and share pins\n\nThree regressions from the command-target migration, all rooted in the vite\nprocess no longer running from the workspace root:\n\n- Analog plugins resolve workspaceRoot/fileReplacements/content paths against\n  process.cwd(), and the content plugin joins cwd-relative glob results with\n  workspaceRoot — both break when cwd is the app dir (preview build failed on\n  CI with UNRESOLVED_ENTRY / UNLOADABLE_DEPENDENCY). Run vite with cwd = ''.''\n  and pass the config explicitly via --config, restoring the old executor''s\n  cwd semantics; keep an explicit workspaceRoot in the analog() options.\n- Tailwind v4 auto-detection is cwd-based, so libs/** and docs/** classes\n  (e.g. the navbar''s md: variants) stopped being generated. Add explicit\n  @source directives for libs and docs.\n- Bump the MF share pins (angVer/cdkMatVer) from ~22.0.x to ~22.1.4 so they\n  satisfy the installed packages and stop the federation runtime\n  version-mismatch warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlJkSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbooQAImzmMfCFN2WDpwdLk8wXTVN\nlxmE4v/7XYiZ9Lwto5jCqSXEPs2g2Ur3OuMJwOGSfIqfWCE0L7fBOtCj0otsfy1H\nHFgZ6Ms64cGAwYKMHo0AfCJh+7yuEL5SOVfrFSYV5X9CbzFIno3ahFQznJaRObKt\nmlk9riOPjyfcYxwl/E37SunqKTMaGbhU63ni7BxdzECB4KaWlRgNlt5sp5YLCi2a\nPGrAVjA8z1VgXB8XZ1rOUdYjCkd2hGrulAMsvBLG9XSw0QZaYCr62o9eCFEQUG7R\nHngyCuD0aMfXNqTa37oDhmuAZfB0mmqprY8XBpDRwJP0B+Xtm9A5JV7zc