m/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/e829d3512d8e236fd70bf5aed0e9e7c3295ec6ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/75796ac52981484443336e21ae5bfafaf99b42e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:46:05Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:46:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: recipe catalog aligned with the codebase, stable signal forms, in-app recipe browser, and consolidated package updates (#217)\n\n* docs: add recipe catalog and refresh README positioning (#213)\n\n- docs/recipes/: 14 recipes documenting the canonical patterns (feature\n  libraries, SignalStore, server-side CRUD, signal forms, error handling,\n  minimal APIs, EF migrations, auth, testing, content pages, PWA, theming,\n  MFEs, deployment) — each links its canonical implementation files\n- README: Angular 21 -> 22, server-side CRUD feature bullet, Recipes section;\n  lint-staged hook now actually runs update-readme (the claim was aspirational)\n- content/home.md twin realigned with the README-derived assets/home.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(skills): add create-feature and upgrade-angular-major skills (#213)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: ignore MSBuild backslash-named build-host dirs on WSL (#213)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: align recipe catalog with the current codebase and add six recipes (#213)\n\n- Rewrite server-crud, signal-forms, error-handling, ef-migrations,\n  minimal-api-ef, and testing recipes to describe the post-revert codebase\n  (in-memory CRUD API, compat signal forms, per-feature error banners,\n  Identity migrations applied manually, webServer-based e2e)\n- Fix stale claims in signal-store, pwa, auth-jwt, and deployment recipes\n- Add six recipes: notification center, route guards, HTTP interceptors,\n  dependency updates, counter feature, weather forecast\n- README + home.md twins: Todos CRUD bullet matches the in-memory API;\n  Recipes section lists the expanded catalog\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(skills): align create-feature skill with the in-memory CRUD reference (#213)\n\n- Step 6 scaffolds an in-memory repository + endpoint group (EF only when\n  persistence is required); xUnit tests target the repository, no SQLite\n- Step 7 e2e follows weather-forecast.e2e.spec.ts; webServer boots the stack\n- Pitfalls: drop paging rows, add MFE NG0203 and mat-error-on-submit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(todo): migrate todo form to the stable signal forms API (closes #215)\n\n- Replace the compat SignalFormControl + FormGroup with the stable\n  form() schema API (FormRoot/FormField directives, model signal as the\n  source of truth, submission action + onInvalid -> markAsTouched)\n- Create-only: no edit flow (the edit-mode prototype lives on PR #214''s\n  branch, commit 48f6740, as a reference)\n- Specs cover create emission with trimmed values, required validation,\n  and form reset after submit\n- Update signal-forms recipe to the stable API and the create-feature\n  skill''s mat-error pitfall row\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(web-app): browse the recipe catalog at /recipes (closes #216)\n\n- apps/web-app/src/content/recipes is a symlink to docs/recipes so the\n  app serves the source-of-truth files (tinyglobby follows symlinks)\n- /recipes index (injectContentFiles filtered to recipes/ slugs) and\n  /recipes/:slug pages (injectContent with param + subdirectory), nav\n  link, shiki cs/sql langs for the C#/SQL code blocks\n- Unit specs with the injectContent mock pattern; recipes e2e spec\n  (catalog list, slug page, back navigation)\n- Fix error-handling recipe frontmatter title (bare '': '' breaks YAML);\n  analog-content recipe documents the param-based slug route + symlink\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(web-app): filter recipe catalog by filename, not slug (#216)\n\n- injectContentFiles() slugs are only the last path segment, and in dev\n  Vite resolves the src/content/recipes symlink to its real docs/recipes\n  path — so the map keys differ between dev and build. The /recipes/\n  segment of file.filename is the stable discriminator.\n- e2e: scope the markdown heading to the page container (hero h1\n  duplicates the title) and the back link to app-recipe (toolbar nav also\n  matches); exact-name matching for the SignalStore link (server-crud''s\n  title also contains ''SignalStore'').\n- Document the filename-vs-slug gotcha in the analog-content recipe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(skills): add recipes skill that dispatches into the catalog (#213)\n\n- Maps an ask to its recipe(s) via a lookup table, then loads the recipe\n  plus its canonical implementation files and follows conventions/gotchas\n- Cross-pattern work follows each recipe''s Related links; verification per\n  the testing recipe, with the recipe kept honest on change\n- Registered in the catalog''s Agent skills section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(web-app): recipe page header alignment and in-app Related links (#216)\n\n- Recipe hero container now matches the body''s max-w-[1440px] so the\n  header lines up with the page content below it\n- Marked extension (content.markedOptions.extensions) rewrites bare\n  <name>.md links — the Related links, correct on GitHub — to\n  /recipes/<name> when rendering in-app; walkTokens hooks post-parse so\n  the built-in link tokenizer still owns matching\n- SWA config 404s stray /*.md URLs instead of bouncing them to home via\n  the SPA fallback\n- e2e: Related-link navigation test (href rewrite + cross-recipe nav);\n  analog-content recipe documents the rewrite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest (folds in dependabot PRs #219, #220, #221)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9440bedfc711581dd5d76110fb4184cbee7c737c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/9440bedfc711581dd5d76110fb4184cbee7c737c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/75796ac52981484443336e21ae5bfafaf99b42e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 9440bedfc711581dd5d76110fb4184cbee7c737c\nparent aae82743eb7713e13ccc3409bbaac9f61b76f403\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1788101165 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788101165 -0400\n\nfeat: recipe catalog aligned with the codebase, stable signal forms, in-app recipe browser, and consolidated package updates (#217)\n\n* docs: add recipe catalog and refresh README pos