alStore'').\n- Document the filename-vs-slug gotcha in the analog-content recipe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(skills): add recipes skill that dispatches into the catalog (#213)\n\n- Maps an ask to its recipe(s) via a lookup table, then loads the recipe\n  plus its canonical implementation files and follows conventions/gotchas\n- Cross-pattern work follows each recipe''s Related links; verification per\n  the testing recipe, with the recipe kept honest on change\n- Registered in the catalog''s Agent skills section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(web-app): recipe page header alignment and in-app Related links (#216)\n\n- Recipe hero container now matches the body''s max-w-[1440px] so the\n  header lines up with the page content below it\n- Marked extension (content.markedOptions.extensions) rewrites bare\n  <name>.md links — the Related links, correct on GitHub — to\n  /recipes/<name> when rendering in-app; walkTokens hooks post-parse so\n  the built-in link tokenizer still owns matching\n- SWA config 404s stray /*.md URLs instead of bouncing them to home via\n  the SPA fallback\n- e2e: Related-link navigation test (href rewrite + cross-recipe nav);\n  analog-content recipe documents the rewrite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest (folds in dependabot PRs #219, #220, #221)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlEItCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoFoQAJBtIc/82L9RbRmCFowvEylS\nOmia2gzINM9Z+bfZhiQ5DnqVSEN6q/PjR/o10YSSE3zE+ChsFI29c/WLW084w4Ig\nAoinae0/CnQTVs9C6YuhVnEpoJ7i15FKHSqowzlCcujWn0ObaqUYfeNpqIatjV1o\n3RgHdE0yYNgQgY4fnL1dBRdAmI7SAjdZQqeT/JC/gqIU6wXOLNT73xZEMcPTkk4W\n6ZsCojCnpkTkIvMebXYdAwX12pN0tZHb91w4gKeu2E2yaJPvUPF3I8YDvu/pTNiZ\n/bEx9SbLjfpu+EUhyQM5FvYmEtZ8cEtZYejdU6GriI3Q0Iu0Q1ypK3v8z9naeq2U\npE+lMSaPNiQhp19RtR5p