st\nexecutor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"449a305642313818a7954f99b9f9134e1e5f57df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/449a305642313818a7954f99b9f9134e1e5f57df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/aae82743eb7713e13ccc3409bbaac9f61b76f403","verification":{"payload":"tree 449a305642313818a7954f99b9f9134e1e5f57df\nparent 59adfc0c1a01d0351123173bc2c52b73639c3f15\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1786808963 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786808963 -0400\n\nchore: update all packages to latest (#212)\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest (closes #211)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dotnet-builder): tolerate stderr output and suppress coverage telemetry\n\ndotnet-coverage 18.10+ prints a one-time telemetry banner to stderr on\nfresh machines, and the executors rejected on any stderr data, failing\napi:test in CI with ''Unknown error caught''. Log stderr as warnings and\nrely on exit codes, and opt out of coverage telemetry in the test\nexecutor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgIqDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr5IQAGobOfs5O7lJ0hnSLXSvq0wX\njlPEMuRVmWRSXHO/RoXW6nFeYwpzGmsGUj2hEBYIkPeZP1j7Zs9d5sS3YRV5FxPC\nVcr+ojPsmJkUaPW6bK19bQyGyxhQir3z8rMhvdHyEYNvtqYu5+enmk4KCuLux5UQ\n+LAXjlPGz5GSZ3Z1L0v+BlwD6ZdiDQ1DWWgVvHHU7epLZeicuzUq12c6Ts/SUifg\nDQAUn3G6KgGWI7l/IWiJvp7bDN93jLVsgrvj4npkfeD8uvDI8MsGfV9APq0xpyYS\nM3CcAfxvb9jC5rJlEISQ14hh+0hFfVmc53ZxVa0SefNxeEE46MiL9bicwBgVRF1j\n5zROfNi/C/KGw1K6RVMFGxLN7MQkWzWvS3sVCIGyjM9D9phJ880Jmg6n81Y+pXDR\njwbLtOl5Dl4P6vTTl9rDPY0x10hOJZPuOW52+p7LDJGvsdSgmbqM43zluEXBoN63\nLB/ZA54demQj+OnJAr0Lez0NjNACGik7srgFYHuUT