bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/820eadedf5f59d1f893c30528e6546b734896f7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T19:48:22Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T19:48:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: security audit — all 35 dependabot alerts resolved or stale (#199)\n\n* chore: [nx migration] checkpoint before running migrations\n\n* chore: [nx migration] 23-0-0-add-migrate-runs-to-git-ignore\n\n* chore: [nx migration] migrate-to-vitest-3\n\n* chore(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 in the github-actions group\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: update all packages to latest\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dotnet-builder): add index.js suffix to builder implementation paths\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: add security audit findings — all 35 dependabot alerts resolved or stale\n\nCloses #197\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: remove security audit findings\n\n* fix: vite warnings, run migration\n\n* fix: vite warnings\n\n* fix: switch counter-remote to @analogjs/platform:vite executor\n\nThe inferred @nx/vite build target doesn''t handle the SSR entry\n(main.server.ts) that @analogjs/vite-plugin-nitro requires, even with\nssr:false. Switching to @analogjs/platform:vite executor matches the\nweb-app pattern and correctly resolves the SSR entry.\n\nAlso removes @nx/vite/plugin from nx.json since counter-remote was\nthe only included project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbf5a358824eb43f0e87c4cac8c00d85bb4caa0b","url":"https://api.github.com/rep