cking (previously ~240 ms FCP delay)\n  while preserving font loading via display=swap.\n- Expected Lighthouse performance improvement: ~87 → ~96+\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5dfba08ea1334b0c6b3a60b7c06abd12525865e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/b5dfba08ea1334b0c6b3a60b7c06abd12525865e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/ba8645efeffdb6f399babd7aca7f6e28b37b2e3f","verification":{"payload":"tree b5dfba08ea1334b0c6b3a60b7c06abd12525865e\nparent ecf6e8abf14ca9a9e32d00cc76701ee799dbf2f9\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1781364752 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781364752 -0400\n\nperf: remove @angular/compiler from MF shared deps, load fonts async (#188)\n\n- Remove @angular/compiler from Module Federation shared singleton deps\n  in both host (web-app) and remote (counter-remote). The JIT compiler\n  is never needed at runtime in AOT production builds — sharing it\n  eagerly loaded ~216 KB (80% unused) on every page view.\n- Load Google Fonts asynchronously using the media=''print'' onload\n  pattern. This prevents render-blocking (previously ~240 ms FCP delay)\n  while preserving font loading via display=swap.\n- Expected Lighthouse performance improvement: ~87 → ~96+\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLXgQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAww8QADDUYHZD6GEmivF+zYjgAahW\n4uXoFZxkF6u/iDAPtPUu3AN8VeWPG5yfaMAwOD1CzL9Per0Py9OjY2Nz0nffoZRq\nLzrVUMqqSyD3O1qO8WN8NBRsJEsf8mZc2LqbbCHGq9S25aB3wV+PGAGLxFhbOgBh\nEu4ELVYrHsWItKaPVsIZttaoT9AtR0yGOQ2H1KUUlXHAJxMsS/1+qT3vYo+ejRF3\ndaMnDbhC1zPQJb3pMMkO6Bhg/CIreAwuB2R4CjG/71tz7XcefU+iNTSLD1bSyzbs\ngq/7v1kHn4ki0lI1yM1fvJum1/Av8/js39UvdAiyEzLHu8oiZ5Upw+GX4y6ZZCQv\neUYWGHCm/WN7X/ye472YnQvIfMAh1PlInnQ6IwqYiUvhTBDiRPktDVF39uVQQj4P\n9w6FlpnfaWSPGSWah1taCtG4iWM