riorities\n- 7 render tests for MigrationProgress: all task states\n- 4 tests for NextStepsRunner non-interactive mode\n- Export extractJsonObject from lib.ts for direct testing\n- Update vite.config.mts to node env (no Angular plugin/jsdom)\n- Add test nx target using @nx/vitest:test\n- Add ink-testing-library devDependency\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: correct tsconfig.app.json spec excludes and vi.fn type syntax\n\n- Exclude *.spec.tsx and *.test.tsx from tsconfig.app.json\n  (was causing build:production to type-check spec files)\n- Fix vi.fn<[StepResult[]], void>() → vi.fn<(r: StepResult[]) => void>()\n  for Vitest v4 API compatibility\n- Fix vite.config.mts to import defineConfig from vitest/config\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cd5429dea86be7d1007acbff3f50de195a77fa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/4cd5429dea86be7d1007acbff3f50de195a77fa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/9a95bbfb0dee5c839e8a383d77b4f390ae9c1a5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 4cd5429dea86be7d1007acbff3f50de195a77fa9\nparent 3773b0d011ba49a1e81756ca79d73844db0263b3\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1776540155 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776540155 -0400\n\ntest: add unit and integration tests for update-packages (#131)\n\n* test: add unit and integration tests for update-packages (closes #130)\n\n- 14 unit tests for lib.ts: extractJsonObject edge cases +\n  buildMigrationQueue ordering/nx/angular priorities\n- 7 render tests for MigrationProgress: all task states\n- 4 tests for NextStepsRunner non-interactive mode\n- Export extractJsonObject from lib.ts for direct testing\n- Update vite.config.mts to node env (no Angular plugi