_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/3773b0d011ba49a1e81756ca79d73844db0263b3","node_id":"C_kwDOBucjadoAKDM3NzNiMGQwMTFiYTQ5YTFlODE3NTZjYTc5ZDczODQ0ZGIwMjYzYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/0a76edd745739e58e9906d345ce0f395e31d3295","sha":"0a76edd745739e58e9906d345ce0f395e31d3295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/0a76edd745739e58e9906d345ce0f395e31d3295"}],"sha":"3773b0d011ba49a1e81756ca79d73844db0263b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/3773b0d011ba49a1e81756ca79d73844db0263b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/0a76edd745739e58e9906d345ce0f395e31d3295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:45:42Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:45:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: refactor update-packages to React Ink + bun runtime with own package.json (#129)\n\n* feat: refactor update-packages to React Ink + bun runtime with own package.json (closes #127)\n\n- Add tools/update-packages/package.json as a proper pnpm workspace package\n  with ink, react, commander deps scoped to the tool\n- Use bun as dev runtime (bun run src/main.tsx) instead of ts-node\n- Rewrite UI with React Ink: spinner while loading, MultiSelect for omitting\n  packages, live per-package migration progress, ConfirmInput for next steps\n- Extract pure async helpers into lib.ts (fetchOutdatedPackages, nxMigrate,\n  mergeMigrations, buildMigrationQueue)\n- Split into App.tsx state machine + components/ (PackageTable, MigrationProgress,\n  Summary, NextStepsRunner)\n- Update tsconfigs: ESNext module, bundler moduleResolution, jsx:react-jsx\n- Update project.json: main.tsx, esm format, bundle:true, new ''dev'' target\n- Remove chalk, inquirer, commander from root package.json\n- Update skill SKILL.md with new bun run command\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: update root script to use bun + main.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: ts errors in update-packages, add pack target and CI step\n\n- MultiSelect onSubmit returns string[] not {value}[] - remove .value access\n- ConfirmInput defaultChoice accepts ''confirm''|''cancel'' not ''yes''|''no''\n- Add pack nx target: patches dist package.json (adds bin, removes private),\n  then runs npm pack --pack-destination .\n- Add pack step to CI workflow (nx affected for PRs, explicit run for main)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: static footer, exit report, onComplete callback (#127)\n\n- App: remove ''done'' phase; add onComplete(CompletionData) prop + exit()\n- NextStepsRunner: pass StepResult[] back to onDone callback\n- MigrationProgress: use <Static> for completed tasks (scroll buffer)\n- main.tsx: capture CompletionData; print chalk summary after waitUntilExit()\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show full package list during migration progress\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: completed packages scroll up via static, pending list pinned at bottom\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: pin footer by placing it last in live area\n\nThe cursor position is stable because <Static> commits one line to the\nscroll buffer for every one line removed from the live area (completed\ntask leaves). Placing the header/counter LAST in the live area means it\nalways sits on the same terminal row — truly pinned.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: pin spinner + counter at bottom, completed items scroll up only\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show pending package list during migration, remove exit summary\n\nCompleted items scroll into the scroll buffer with checkmarks via <Static>.\nPending items remain visible in the live area below the running spinner.\nExit summary removed since all packages persist on screen.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: move spinner to bottom of live area below pending list and counter\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: drop Static, render all tasks in single live area\n\ncompleted items turn green in-place, pending stay dimmed,\nspinner + counter always at the bottom. no more disappearing items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove Summary block from next-steps phase\n\nmigration list already shows all results; summary was redundant\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show running task in list with › symbol, keep list visible in next-steps\n\n- running task shows as ''› name'' (yellow) instead of disappearing\n- MigrationProgress rendered above NextStepsRunner so completed list\n  stays on screen when prompting for pnpm install / nx migrate\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use ◆ icon for in-progress package instead of ›\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove duplicate next-steps output after ink exits\n\nNextStepsRunner already shows ✓/○ in the Ink UI; printing again\nfrom main.tsx after waitUntilExit() caused a duplicate line.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: make onComplete optional, remove empty no-op from main.tsx\n\nfixes no-empty-function and no-unused-vars lint errors in ci\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d324ad614f8ca24b8d5e1bb1fb4cb9cad5e6dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/7d324ad614f8ca24b8d5e1bb1fb4cb9cad5e6dd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/0a76edd745739e58e9906d345ce0f395e31d3295","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d324ad614f8ca24b8d5e1bb1fb4cb9cad5e6dd1\nparent c172eb4a4ab2b2e0d3e5fb97c1016581ef7aaa2c\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1776537942 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776537942 -0400\n\nfeat: refactor update-packages to React Ink + bun runtime with own package.json (#129)\n\n* feat: refactor update-packages to React Ink + bun runtime with own package.json (closes #127)\n\n- Add tools/update-packages/package.json as a proper pnpm workspace package\n  with ink, react, commander deps scoped to the tool\n- Use bun as dev runtime (bun run src/main.tsx) instead of ts-node\n- Rewrite UI with React Ink: spinner while loading, MultiSelect for omitting\n  packages, live per-package migration progress, ConfirmInput for next steps\n- Extract pure async helpers into lib.ts (fetchOutdatedPackages, nxMigrate,\n  mergeMigrations, buildMigrationQueue)\n- Split into App.tsx state machine + components/ (PackageTable, MigrationProgress,\n  Summary, NextStepsRunner)\n- Update tsconfigs: ESNext module, bundler moduleResolution, jsx:react-jsx\n- Update project.json: main.tsx, esm format, bundle:true, new ''dev'' target\n- Remove chalk, inquirer, commander from root package.json\n- Update skill SKILL.md with new bun run command\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: update root script to use bun + main.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: ts errors in update-packages, add pack target and CI step\n\n- MultiSelect onSubmit returns string[] not {value}[] - remove .value access\n- ConfirmInput defaultChoice accepts ''confirm''|''cancel'' not ''yes''|''no''\n- Add pack nx target: patches dist package.json (adds bin, removes private),\n  then runs npm pack --pack-destination .\n- Add pack step to CI workflow (nx affected for PRs, explicit run for main)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: static footer, exit report, onComplete callback (#127)\n\n- App: remove ''done'' phase; add onComplete(CompletionData) prop + exit()\n- NextStepsRunner: pass StepResult[] back to onDone callback\n- MigrationProgress: use <Static> for completed tasks (scroll buffer)\n- main.tsx: capture CompletionData; print chalk summary after waitUntilExit()\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show full package list during migration progress\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: completed packages scroll up via static, pending list pinned at bottom\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: pin footer by placing it last in live area\n\nThe cursor position is stable because <Static> commits one line to the\nscroll buffer for every one line removed from the live area (completed\ntask leaves). Placing the header/counter LAST in the live area means it\nalways sits on the same terminal row — truly pinned.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: pin spinner + counter at bottom, completed items scroll up only\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show pending package list during migration, remove exit summary\n\nCompleted items scroll into the scroll buffer with checkmarks via <Static>.\nPending items remain visible in the live area below the running spinner.\nExit summary removed since all packages persist on screen.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: move spinner to bottom of live area below pending list and counter\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: drop Static, render all tasks in single live area\n\ncompleted items turn green in-place, pending stay dimmed,\nspinner + counter always at the bottom. no more disappearing items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove Summary block from next-steps phase\n\nmigration list already shows all results; summary was redundant\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: show running task in list with › symbol, keep list visible in next-steps\n\n- running task shows as ''› name'' (yellow) instead of disappearing\n- MigrationProgress rendered above NextStepsRunner so completed list\n  stays on screen when prompting for pnpm install / nx migrate\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use ◆ icon for in-progress package instead of ›\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove duplicate next-steps output after ink exits\n\nNextStepsRunner already shows ✓/○ in the Ink UI; printing again\nfrom main.tsx after waitUntilExit() caused a duplicate line.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: make onComplete optional, remove empty no-op from main.tsx\n\nfixes no-empty-function and no-unused-vars lint errors in ci\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp49FWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf4MQAACzT4a0oGbfh7MQ6CZx906c\nZVgXPQ8Gbi9KbowaiSmzI7UFBE2+JIbHQMdSAj3Bu7nPx6mVBFTMprgkiDKKVbYd\nYIaz4cElLM73RhxdsbC84yDqWxltytoEtSR+4Upp/9Qji/rBG0h8ZnRaLeMIc1nQ\nx0PBTJkWCCPYjjutwZUEk59eJlGurft76CbwFQiw9sfjemg5/ELyv7pG5dajbkhj\nsejyfxrGFkMeRDj2i57orb836F2r++ZXCkBXLBKkaLpidD9fRTyocmUSD/QK9sBu\ngDs6Ssr3YIQrOY3J5rzlSIdQvYkRgVOYTXTd/Ys8yZBi4lWprGwfv4AKRE40IDtt\nisZVbtMdlSIk2wAl98RX4dC6Fa3rnvgDa3i2Po+YENmWPOJrSPTtrSbraJxMcQ9S\nO571aL11VU/lficnjPjwWK7us6WLfS2XPiJLAJfr3HXqDPp5vnrzabKi0i4pKzUo\nS3d2Mer19c6Q2I7HJk/qIwqgsAK4Yy4Bb61XAzsIn/Fs7H7GEedMRl6oXBN8dUUt\n3w15n4lRssSHdMtWYMPeQ2ehocJJ1fJtW32D/LjnnrHAJkXXsnrrt/zWqVUbU3HH\n6QFXCot0W4MkxWQ0oqbFOuq0S9AyEVQonyATgSbx8BXxTyrVDa2H4u95tvKXRyjZ\nVQlKEhonl1u9Skix8ANN\n=/QHc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T18:45:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"