425f42d66579cb15f7b00224ace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/8aa406fac979d703d9ed822c0a7aa16909a78809","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ad42590da13e425f42d66579cb15f7b00224ace\nparent 813bf226530add74bfa87da6c376ca9e76772b68\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1774115174 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774115174 -0400\n\nfix: update packages and add @oxc-project/runtime (closes #81) (#82)\n\nVite 8 uses Rolldown/OXC which injects @oxc-project/runtime helpers when\ntransforming Angular modules. The package was not installed, causing all\nVitest test suites to fail with an unresolved import error.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvtlmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU1MQAJKR1SN7/I5gadupBda5S/g6\nMfVbmIJRdl83HnVj0Nyx0NhwzZ7LGXYXoeHv+0x86D5ziEptpLoaPQiffzdFti49\nfGDk7ZSHF1mg9Zx47gl68TDP/w8sJnCZkID3UXBYcBGX7OG7oTlT18VQfqAXdgeo\n9yxxLETsMMhQeSqP2yCS3q+DePOUHTG1oAuqsLilkMpzs4Lkth/BzShtUO5CzInw\nith1XVTY/51MuWy6BbCBTvaUPLSR1h83Bd7YsZO/iW4gsm8hBbHFFRvBHrkB6N5u\n2Mh2kLmwLh25ULej2zTfC3A+OzSNJfb66AuhrF/BhnRlu7oWbLranjr3Ga9q4/pX\n/IbjEwym4gyQkiXWSBU7KPE3dcGz3fkB2bSl6Is/UNOVzgQ/6VECrVUx+fId/Rka\niUQAvYzT0la1yKR0EUy2/Pi3hVua5yvbyvw5vgLt56c7SnBhmZwfzMur+D3hrMgv\nHGJET6Sun7ba8UY3QZxPzeD8pDAsh2tGYrKLZMsPNPXSRjSrnDvJJZH0lj+2nAEw\nUEpF4tEfLYnjHQ7z4bz0om0T9TlAdKqTLJhbipFYhF4C6+2rscoSmdKlskdQqXs7\nRqMu1/MSaSuKNIN1Li20DxynUHD7yFcXfJtF/g9Hx0CtknU4DUEL4kcEGX/Tmeah\nOpuJ9xx5TkrSDnJ2dlVp\n=3PxR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-21T17:46:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url