"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/ce576688bcaf9a8520fe5fad748b0e4c77213054/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T01:32:59Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T01:32:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: fail-fast config validation and post-deploy smoke test (#77)\n\n* fix: fail-fast config validation and post-deploy smoke test (closes #75)\n\nAdd startup validation to Program.cs that throws immediately if any\nrequired JWT config values are absent. This surfaces missing env vars\nas a clear error in Azure logs on boot rather than as silent 500s at\nruntime.\n\nAdd a post-deploy smoke test to deploy.yml that retries /api/weatherforecasts\nup to 5 times (15s apart) after deployment. The workflow fails if the\nendpoint does not return HTTP 200, preventing a broken deploy from\ngoing undetected.\n\nRoot cause documented in issue #76.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: add liveness/readiness health endpoints and smoke test\n\nAdd /health/live (liveness, no DB check) and /health/ready (readiness,\nincludes SQL Server check) using ASP.NET Core built-in health checks +\nAspNetCore.HealthChecks.SqlServer.\n\nThe deploy smoke test hits /health/live so a sleeping serverless Azure\nSQL DB does not cause false failures. /health/ready is available for\nuptime monitoring and alerting.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* style: fix missing newline in Program.cs\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9530d3eeb91e38c2cca27a0bb9ccea226bcc6d82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/9530d3eeb91e38c2cca27a0bb9ccea226bcc6d82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/ce576688bcaf9a8520fe5fad748b0e4c77213054","verification":{"payload":"tree 9530d3eeb91e38c2cca27a0bb9ccea226bcc6d82\nparent db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773711179 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773711179 -0400\n\nfix: fail-fast config validation and post-deploy smoke test (#77)\n\n* fix: fail-fast config validation and post-deploy smoke test (closes #75)\n\nAdd startup validation to Program.cs that throws immediately if any\nrequired JWT config values are absent. This surfaces missing env vars\nas a clear error in Azure logs on boot rather than as silent 500s at\nruntime.\n\nAdd a post-deploy smoke test to deploy.yml that retries /api/weatherforecasts\nup to 5 times (15s apart) after deployment. The workflow fails if the\nendpoint does not return HTTP 200, preventing a broken deploy from\ngoing undetected.\n\nRoot cause documented in issue #76.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: add liveness/readiness health endpoints and smoke test\n\nAdd /health/live (liveness, no DB check) and /health/ready (readiness,\nincludes SQL Server check) using ASP.NET Core built-in health checks +\nAspNetCore.HealthChecks.SqlServer.\n\nThe deploy smoke test hits /health/live so a sleeping serverless Azure\nSQL DB does not cause false failures. /health/ready is available for\nuptime monitoring and alerting.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* style: fix missing newline in Program.cs\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuK9LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1KMQAK/uhrP6Ii6/5TPqKT/o6xYw\nEGUay8JxU281In83mqlic2xyM5qEsUeencNOHFlXaa+s/rCLtWJoOtTETPh3/I+2\niunh/O4G+nKd5PapJXa1aoSseLGNBGSVs/zdFht41mhQywbTZuKu5HBPCWS7XN2y\nB3yUtUo6zoEcEIKpFTuE2vcvp/42e1xnfRvOldi3fQ4gNQmUet2QkrcbRskx1WkT\nMS9WhvxGXB7AaWJg+Qku2jyKa4dh2ZumDy58MCUI+lnLmSh23XQKapOdTCUlrBwL\nv/ksrepjCd4l0W+pMXnKnFOSrj8OYUsOOMzKoZQjkWre25CFhRd1w7Hyt2lgqOdI\ndtcu/YDgyHQbtigXr7EOOVIA3UMfoVQnGBv4OejAqeqxCfDjiBExUr9VEh1Od7lT\nsf+DksEFVMcoA6cFOqAqeq9W7+uclvGoiaPHlsFRiaCLNLeBnh6iuQJFec4URFzD\nHxpuSRFk1xzewX19VYTMhYDZ5Qafus8Ywb5AyfBZsa8Bnbdv8h7ruBMttTVqWFOH\n9RodZ3iD6ebljH9xHtaj/FJ3fTObvuOjDV7KcQ/X/zySk3Ci5jmFjNduIVHK+0wB\nYR0LZP18r36K1fmdIbnWz/ELh+UqIlKsHHKPcNsTfpAO/inYF33zMVurR4xa20C1\nEayd2plwivLIGVGuGBo7\n=T+4O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T01:32:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/ce576688bcaf9a8520fe5fad748b0e4c77213054","node_id":"C_kwDOBucjadoAKGNlNTc2Njg4YmNhZjlhODUyMGZlNWZhZDc0OGIwZTRjNzcyMTMwNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9","sha":"db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9"}],"sha":"ce576688bcaf9a8520fe5fad748b0e4c77213054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/ce576688bcaf9a8520fe5fad748b0e4c77213054"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T22:03:05Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T22:03:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add explicit GITHUB_TOKEN permissions to workflows (#74)\n\n* fix: add explicit GITHUB_TOKEN permissions to workflows (closes #73)\n\nLock down GITHUB_TOKEN to minimum required permissions per job,\nfollowing principle of least privilege (CodeQL alerts #1, #2, #3).\n\nci.yml:       contents: read, pull-requests: write\npreview.yml:  deploy_preview: contents: read + pull-requests: write\n              close_preview:  pull-requests: write only (no checkout)\n\ndeploy.yml already had explicit permissions and is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: skip coverage comment steps when no coverage files are generated\n\nWhen a PR only changes non-code files (e.g. workflow YAML), nx affected\nruns no tests so no coverage XML is produced and code-coverage-results.md\nis never created. The sticky-pull-request-comment step then fails with\n''Either message or path input is required''.\n\n- Add continue-on-error to CodeCoverageSummary (graceful no-op)\n- Add a Check step that sets coverage.outputs.exists\n- Gate annotate, summary, and comment steps on that output\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2094cdac57f2abb542cb9851420e34c3372fc4a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/2094cdac57f2abb542cb9851420e34c3372fc4a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9","verification":{"payload":"tree 2094cdac57f2abb542cb9851420e34c3372fc4a6\nparent 0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773698585 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773698585 -0400\n\nfix: add explicit GITHUB_TOKEN permissions to workflows (#74)\n\n* fix: add explicit GITHUB_TOKEN permissions to workflows (closes #73)\n\nLock down GITHUB_TOKEN to minimum required permissions per job,\nfollowing principle of least privilege (CodeQL alerts #1, #2, #3).\n\nci.yml:       contents: read, pull-requests: write\npreview.yml:  deploy_preview: contents: read + pull-requests: write\n              close_preview:  pull-requests: write only (no checkout)\n\ndeploy.yml already had explicit permissions and is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: skip coverage comment steps when no coverage files are generated\n\nWhen a PR only changes non-code files (e.g. workflow YAML), nx affected\nruns no tests so no coverage XML is produced and code-coverage-results.md\nis never created. The sticky-pull-request-comment step then fails with\n''Either message or path input is required''.\n\n- Add continue-on-error to CodeCoverageSummary (graceful no-op)\n- Add a Check step that sets coverage.outputs.exists\n- Gate annotate, summary, and comment steps on that output\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuH4ZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0i8QABrme/0w0cI1k6v1dR43OD/N\n/Qb4mKxUHMGfeaXDW1+X8qNfY1qSz3xD6QiK+whiJH4wx79p1j50eaWG7dl/LcCh\nAdvw5kh5+3nV5AuO3Zk6kQn9QolRkslSV2/PTTITAabPtqEQvEUO6URKoXuQ0E9p\nNwKKChgjEjnX44q9xYIuB6JpoaRdsO3w4h1YFKUK1g4yCzTTJEQQNxMTXZalSi8k\njFo1f3UIvpUJD4NjIBs/sHMvTtM3RFtMgMFSVgjJwew3jDIiPYdF68hb2QuxcWhU\nVk37IyC8cSdwLBk9XpDWeyTTZvlpEn3Y1nZ4C0v8wJTIEfCPqIXmVOmmTFK7vVQF\nO6zMtv0Dz6+d49/97Hgl1gGS3qZFQOvJZyWdf6Pu0cZw4tyQX3sTQSDkvzdifE0B\npiAZs/TfBEi3h/0zAK9cw8WKLLCAA8PSbTmtJ/F5XEdbw9Te5CBu3p1pScpdXH1s\n4SigTUP/QpfDUsbzuG+DVBY8QIFcxjWdED/wtacVDt5T1z1cxiM9DMwBUL9aBEll\nXa7FEzswdNAmf3/87AbUidF3q15udgZCIapHKoj2Wb2ly/O7B0WZapjKSldQdHrj\n+wJG16EWioQBH1phQvKvZuH/fxvKv//T/O7ZVruzK3CrkxUnDZZcNxmhTV7H+wo2\naN5e3S5JljWPNcgb/dLk\n=sELI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T22:03:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9","node_id":"C_kwDOBucjadoAKGRiOTY3ZTk5MDIyYmU5MDBlYTdjODdjZWJiZWNlZjZlNzNiNzUyYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544","sha":"0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544"}],"sha":"db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/db967e99022be900ea7c87cebbecef6e73b752c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T21:30:21Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T21:30:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: migrate to JWT + HttpOnly cookie refresh tokens, add 2FA UI (#72)\n\n* feat: migrate to JWT + HttpOnly cookie refresh tokens, add 2FA UI (closes #71)\n\n- Replace opaque bearer tokens with HS256 JWTs (1h access tokens)\n- Add TokenService for JWT access + random refresh token generation\n- Add RefreshToken EF entity with unique index; migration AddRefreshTokens\n- Add AuthEndpoints: POST /api/auth/login, /refresh (cookie), /logout\n- Token rotation on every refresh; /logout revokes server-side token\n- Configure JwtBearer auth in Program.cs; CORS AllowCredentials\n- Frontend AuthService: /api/auth/* endpoints, withCredentials: true\n- AuthStore: remove localStorage; refresh() is rxMethod<void>; add\n  requires-2fa status; logout() calls server-side revoke first\n- AuthInterceptor: call store.refresh() on 401, no localStorage check\n- Login form: show 2FA input when loginStatus === ''requires-2fa''\n- All 29 tests pass, 100% coverage\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: skip refresh on startup when no session cookie exists\n\nAdd a JS-readable `auth_status=1` presence indicator cookie alongside\nthe HttpOnly refresh token. Angular checks this cookie on init and only\ncalls /api/auth/refresh if a session might exist, avoiding a guaranteed\n401 round-trip for users who have never logged in.\n\n- AuthEndpoints: set auth_status on login/refresh, clear on logout\n- auth.store: check document.cookie in withAuthHooks before refreshing\n- specs: remove flush of init refresh; add cookie-present test cases\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: suppress CodeQL false positive on auth_status indicator cookie\n\nThe auth_status cookie is intentionally JS-readable — it is a presence\nindicator containing no sensitive data. The HttpOnly refresh token is\na separate cookie. Add lgtm suppression comment to prevent re-opening.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chrisjwalk <8442112+chrisjwalk@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"221abaef68552be9862ed9bc9a599221b48be65e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/221abaef68552be9862ed9bc9a599221b48be65e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/0b813702b8010d68e68cf4b97af80a39fff5f544","verification":{"payload":"tree 221abaef68552be9862ed9bc9a599221b48be65e\nparent 916c50684f16df3c2337fa72c61510e144e5ce7b\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773696621 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773696621 -0400\n\nfeat: migrate to JWT + HttpOnly cookie refresh tokens, add 2FA UI (#72)\n\n* feat: migrate to JWT + HttpOnly cookie refresh tokens, add 2FA UI (closes #71)\n\n- Replace opaque bearer tokens with HS256 JWTs (1h access tokens)\n- Add TokenService for JWT access + random refresh token generation\n- Add RefreshToken EF entity with unique index; migration AddRefreshTokens\n- Add AuthEndpoints: POST /api/auth/login, /refresh (cookie), /logout\n- Token rotation on every refresh; /logout revokes server-side token\n- Configure JwtBearer auth in Program.cs; CORS AllowCredentials\n- Frontend AuthService: /api/auth/* endpoints, withCredentials: true\n- AuthStore: remove localStorage; refresh() is rxMethod<void>; add\n  requires-2fa status; logout() calls server-side revoke first\n- AuthInterceptor: call store.refresh() on 401, no localStorage check\n- Login form: show 2FA input when loginStatus === ''requires-2fa''\n- All 29 tests pass, 100% coverage\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: skip refresh on startup when no session cookie exists\n\nAdd a JS-readable `auth_status=1` presence indicator cookie alongside\nthe HttpOnly refresh token. Angular checks this cookie on init and only\ncalls /api/auth/refresh if a session might exist, avoiding a guaranteed\n401 round-trip for users who have never logged in.\n\n- AuthEndpoints: set auth_status on login/refresh, clear on logout\n- auth.store: check document.cookie in withAuthHooks before refreshing\n- specs: remove flush of init refresh; add cookie-present test cases\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: suppress CodeQL false positive on auth_status indicator cookie\n\nThe auth_status cookie is intentionally JS-readable — it is a presence\nindicator containing no sensitive data. The HttpOnly refresh token is\na separate cookie. Add lgtm suppression comment to prevent re-opening.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chrisjwalk <8442112+chrisjwalk@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuHZtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcgIQALG0lTp4csfqeLexkZt9be+G\nQlLU4wpZjdySeus9+Hnr72cBfQhf6KyzmKBQ85E3aK60eU+JMMpFKaGZk6+5i1+N\nwU17VDahPGvTTx0abTufDwMxjRFfiWIZRqKBoWr/uA2fFll6TlWxFzYZ1HoW7gP1\nI8+5juho6WvGNRY3zz3Pryh09029b1H8Q/F1Y3ih8kBD1PNN1qOBacB9xfwQsi4z\nZ7uZDy2VJK9Ir33c1KNnaohdWI+D7QeTWXzW8cGPQAjiXisbUzFdf3o4T1iqM+3n\ny1xRC/FTB/7PAW5fpD1zR7rHHeWymnhdbPRtYY6syB8IeLg7PVksKtgrtlj7MiPk\nw8ElMZjq86uahTyIm23OvpMLUrScPV4XOeLjU+wXe+1R/uZPf08hYRRCkU6EgXXn\nuAdDOesOQ5XSnBY1/cuhAduGY+xerQJX8Ve8AtgkPEp9lSczAy6YopXSdUPDlKuG\nf0c+GvC59ceqSHp+aZ/45y0K8o1rGLCWh1lFHHTUXy0U6vajX9O7Gc3MykLwykWz\nvUPL0nVchRdXfeRi1Wv+/zUC/UJ5pWH9XSA3MalBHgU/2XumX15uFTVRMyiiHzhP\nB+9FDwSxzz/cs7fXVfmQ6TYRdDZQzD+l1OILfFKWr9yXTX06MahPTp3s10MYOOBV\n52Ow6DiGdALCxluyAmdp\n=b5i8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T21:30:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angula