om/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/5b4259109454b205068246ff339a56fe2d5f45f6","sha":"5b4259109454b205068246ff339a56fe2d5f45f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/5b4259109454b205068246ff339a56fe2d5f45f6"}],"sha":"916c50684f16df3c2337fa72c61510e144e5ce7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/916c50684f16df3c2337fa72c61510e144e5ce7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/5b4259109454b205068246ff339a56fe2d5f45f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T19:17:33Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T19:17:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(auth): address security issues and bugs in authentication flow (closes #69) (#70)\n\n- Remove removeRefreshToken() from loginStart() to prevent losing the\n  session when a network error occurs during token refresh; call it\n  explicitly only at the start of a fresh login (not during refresh)\n- Swap token storage order in loginSuccessful(): persist the new refresh\n  token before updating state so a page reload mid-swap never loses it\n- Guard store.refresh() in the interceptor with a loginLoading() check\n  so concurrent 401 responses only trigger one refresh round-trip\n- Replace ''|| store.expired()'' with only status === 401 in the\n  interceptor catchError; non-401 errors no longer spuriously kick off\n  a token refresh when the client-side clock says the token is expired\n- Add per-IP fixed-window rate limiting (10 req/min) to all\n  /api/account/* endpoints via AddRateLimiter to mitigate brute force\n- Configure BearerTokenOptions explicitly: access 1 h, refresh 7 d\n- Allow localhost origins in CORS during development\n- Remove hardcoded test access token and credentials from Api.http\n- Replace pre-filled test@test.com/SuperSecret1! defaults in the login\n  form with empty strings\n- Add/update tests covering the corrected interceptor and store behaviour\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f09b4290657666e22ee4fe9e6e6f184d4c579f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/4f09b4290657666e22ee4fe9e6e6f184d4c579f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/5b4259109454b205068246ff339a56fe2d5f45f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f09b4290657666e22ee4fe9e6e6f184d4c579f7\nparent b7b5b9ec6554ef37c3f77f87cba8beb0f0fdc834\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773688653 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773688653 -0400\n\nfix(auth): address security issues and bugs in authentication flow (closes #69) (#70)\n\n- Remove removeRefreshToken() from loginStart() to prevent losing the\n  session when a network error occurs during token refresh; call it\n  explicitly only at the start of a fresh login (not during refresh)\n- Swap token storage order in loginSuccessful(): persist the new refresh\n  token before updating state so a page reload mid-swap never loses it\n- Guard store.refresh() in the interceptor with a loginLoading() check\n  so concurrent 401 responses only trigger one refresh round-trip\n- Replace ''|| store.expired()'' with only status === 401 in the\n  interceptor catchError; non-401 errors no longer spuriously kick off\n  a token refresh when the client-side clock says the token is expired\n- Add per-IP fixed-window rate limiting (10 req/min) to all\n  /api/account/* endpoints via AddRateLimiter to mitigate brute force\n- Configure BearerTokenOptions explicitly: access 1 h, refresh 7 d\n- Allow localhost origins in CORS during development\n- Remove hardcoded test access token and credentials from Api.http\n- Replace pre-filled test@test.com/SuperSecret1! defaults in the login\n  form with empty strings\n- Add/update tests covering the corrected interceptor and store behaviour\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuFdNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi1sQAAsf6E9rbMvA5S6wQa7nWrk5\nMWGfA0uPAo4EB3UIT23flWQVyoD3njRYFjXtBBLOSN8smRY22MGwOV/qiu1Nm2yZ\nCR26feuGq9wjT/BNQh0+xukqTfTlnp23eaa9vLgSL6/FJMlWSJ+ftOlelCjMTWy8\neBU4Sntw30HVuv/dY2Uou4YKn584DH72vOvaNQS+krN1XYm6SyUffQhTeinBTwaP\nE/IKkv+72mveYGr/4lcEHu5EFjYA0t0mFGF2QoJd5E4DOPEmns+NvvxFu+1CY/w7\nr/66Uh7E3eiXKGquRRKwW03k18PnQD1KfvXUAKsiOIzsfqUxEOQyQXsRdC9Tof/5\n6SVPSnjapgiP6sLGKF9/wOg6bV3ERGFXLuWhO0RMzsSQwqIMwE4pWZnJnBIud0sV\n+awi1IjEIn4hVZp2vJcCJHZMXH8wUqFhjk7taqkU2odBCNZCnoH8qy0ZaCZiCvE6\nGY/b2eshzdBpHogpY5Kmi1+eNfdlem6HMKlxW/UUDj/3aYqwspcF2Fm38cgIZeAf\naXpiU3jNC+4ZX7a7WUhDFcSTWsIYvnw+3xp07w/u4ICn5SnESrWmSepRVh7VdjYj\nL2IW37gDWRz2Hw8qNglUl5C7CpMj6+WYn0k+5OTI516FsxXU68Cn4dQfBxqnU79F\nJbEUH9UuXNZdNHYamksB\n