ent.preview.ts\n- Add staticwebapp.config.json for SPA fallback routing in Azure SWA\n- Add CORS policy in Program.cs allowing *.azurestaticapps.net origins\n- Add preview.yml workflow: builds Angular with the preview config,\n  deploys to Azure SWA on PR open/sync, closes staging env on PR close\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(ci): post preview URL as PR comment after SWA deploy\n\nCaptures static_web_app_url output from the deploy step and posts it\nas a comment on the PR. Updates the existing comment on re-deploys\nrather than adding a new one each time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(ci): remove duplicate preview URL comment step\n\nAzure/static-web-apps-deploy already posts a PR comment when repo_token\nis provided. Remove the redundant actions/github-script step.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8dd63cb292f5bd3ed0270a655a63c17ca80b840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/e8dd63cb292f5bd3ed0270a655a63c17ca80b840"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/68657b9034ec3ec25a954d176aa5f44a3669048c","verification":{"payload":"tree e8dd63cb292f5bd3ed0270a655a63c17ca80b840\nparent d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773597902 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773597902 -0400\n\nfeat: add PR preview deployments via Azure Static Web Apps (#65)\n\n* feat: add PR preview deployments via Azure Static Web Apps\n\nCloses #64\n\n- Add apiBaseUrlInterceptor: prepends apiBaseUrl to /api/* requests,\n  allowing the Angular app to call the production backend from a\n  different origin in preview builds\n- Add environment files: environment.ts (empty = same-origin, used in\n  dev and prod) and environment.preview.ts (production App Service URL)\n- Add preview build configuration in project.json with fileReplacements\n  to swap in environment.preview.ts\n- Add staticwebapp.config.json for SPA fallback routing in Azure SWA\n- Add CORS policy in Program.cs allowing *.azurestaticapps.net origins\n- Add preview.yml workflow: builds Angular with the preview config,\n  deploys to Azure SWA on PR open/sync, closes staging env on PR close\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(ci): post preview URL as PR comment after SWA deploy\n\nCaptures static_web_app_url output from the deploy step and posts it\nas a comment on the PR. Updates the existing comment on re-deploys\nrather than adding a new one each time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(ci): remove duplicate preview URL comment step\n\nAzure/static-web-apps-deploy already posts a PR comment when repo_token\nis provided. Remove the redundant actions/github-script step.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptvTOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACDoQAGJDnov4n8u0D3Eh+e0pLemH\nK9/e26zn5LheZ2nxsggAtXFpCnnpYsftQVs4GsGOJN34J4GnTnHO3zlwwP6AAYLJ\nKIvcY4cwfXWZJDCqtoSmK5bf40DGbOsiZPnZChi6IEUDShSYqC8QVM/D6rDaz7ss\nzroDXBhLkYooqZ3YAe2/k/Fk2QnO8Tn7bgdDzbfmTGfVRAcmVZ+R5w8xc4+vHFTV\neAaGVAEbRt/WZe7vDF5S/+Gnb/8HewU/w6OUByWAtlnmtUo71r8jzjfgW5Fcoaiw\nid4s0Elfxo6HVzua7gFNkSCehUwklbK7XD4oBJh7ZFj8HqEoHsLoGJbARiMRrwwg\nhmupox/MTQd1mhVGbq5qUMe7DD0qv97dGanG+q+qCPmtR0lNrU5qp4MLGOjC3ePC\nwhC0c4rWOL8AhvmmlWArn+eWJMZsJgnBWLkHB8Rv6dVDtHxjn2APkBhBHTkJDCpE\n+V4y7/MYGT1nMJBN13YpW3Ku2auhvNxa0GAoCLe41jsVMBokiNCYBbEbbiHruUl9\nhmTXoIM/UxtDW+VflX/rtrw62CphCU3LxaozPJXgqfesGCsrt3RHa4JhCU7aa1xA\nrxp6U8LtLiEMbks2FkrCfQYT8lrowpsNikhR0Ptasm78vb/+w1Hp7eX204kYNmvB\n6EABKUrdN97/Qe2Df5jM\n=/xT5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-15T18:05:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/68657b9034ec3ec25a954d176aa5f44a3669048c","node_id":"C_kwDOBucjadoAKDY4NjU3YjkwMzRlYzNlYzI1YTk1NGQxNzZhYTVmNDRhMzY2OTA0OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commit/d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14","sha":"d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14"}],"sha":"68657b9034ec3ec25a954d176aa5f44a3669048c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/68657b9034ec3ec25a954d176aa5f44a3669048c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/commits/d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T17:42:06Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T17:42:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: replace snackbar with persistent notification centre (#63)\n\n* feat: replace snackbar with notification centre (closes #62)\n\n- Add NotificationStore (NgRx Signal Store) with add/dismiss/markRead/\n  markAllRead methods, unreadCount computed signal, and autoDismissMs\n  support for transient notifications\n- Add NotificationList component — shared panel content used by both\n  CdkOverlay (desktop) and MatBottomSheet (mobile)\n- Add NotificationBell component — bell icon with matBadge count badge,\n  opens CdkOverlay dropdown on desktop and MatBottomSheet on mobile,\n  marks all read on open\n- Update SwUpdateStore to use NotificationStore instead of MatSnackBar;\n  remove snackbar-specific state fields (message/action/snackbarConfig)\n- Add lib-notification-bell to MainToolbar\n- Provide NotificationStore alongside SwUpdateStore in app.ts\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(shared): add unit tests for NotificationBell and NotificationList\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): anchor overlay to button element; add min-height to empty panel\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): use click event target as overlay anchor\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(main-toolbar): move notification bell to far right, after nav links\n\nBell is now rightmost item (logged out) or second from right next to\nlogout (logged in), matching Facebook/LinkedIn pattern. This also\nfixes overlay positioning since the bell is now at the viewport edge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): use global position strategy anchored to top-right\n\nDrops the flexibleConnectedTo approach entirely. Panel is now fixed at\nright:8px top:72px (below the toolbar), matching Facebook/LinkedIn style.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): widen panel to 380px and fix overlay top offset for 56px toolbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): make host display:block so w-full fills overlay pane\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): flush top to 56px toolbar, right to 16px to clear scrollbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(styles): add scrollbar-gutter:stable to prevent layout shift on scroll\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(styles): move scrollbar-gutter:stable to main scroll container, not html\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: remove scrollbar-gutter:stable, causes unwanted gap on non-scrolling pages\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(debug): add secret /debug page with notification test buttons\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): fix unread border and min-height\n\n- Use [class.border-l-4] + [class.border-l-blue-500] so border fully\n  disappears on mark-read (border-neutral-100 was overriding border-l-transparent)\n- Move min-h off container onto empty state only\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): restore unread dot indicator next to title\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(dx): add reload action to debug sw-update notification\n\nMirrors the real sw-update store action so the debug page accurately\nrepresents the notification UX — shows the Reload button and triggers\nwindow.location.reload() when clicked.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove NavigationEnd polling from SwUpdateStore\n\nPolling checkForUpdate() on every NavigationEnd risked adding a new\nsw-update notification on each navigation while an update was pending.\nThe Angular SW checks for updates automatically on load and via its own\ninternal schedule — manual polling is unnecessary.\n\nRemoves: checkForUpdate rxMethod, Router dependency, related tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chrisjwalk <8442112+chrisjwalk@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"47942ccb9823d9d3f0cb920db21aa5d1031d2ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/47942ccb9823d9d3f0cb920db21aa5d1031d2ffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/d60bc3fb5af941f4274decceac11879153142f14","verification":{"payload":"tree 47942ccb9823d9d3f0cb920db21aa5d1031d2ffc\nparent 754a359dbf2f8cb8207538e3b66c77f5e1e6d0bf\nauthor chrisjwalk-bot <268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773596526 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773596526 -0400\n\nfeat: replace snackbar with persistent notification centre (#63)\n\n* feat: replace snackbar with notification centre (closes #62)\n\n- Add NotificationStore (NgRx Signal Store) with add/dismiss/markRead/\n  markAllRead methods, unreadCount computed signal, and autoDismissMs\n  support for transient notifications\n- Add NotificationList component — shared panel content used by both\n  CdkOverlay (desktop) and MatBottomSheet (mobile)\n- Add NotificationBell component — bell icon with matBadge count badge,\n  opens CdkOverlay dropdown on desktop and MatBottomSheet on mobile,\n  marks all read on open\n- Update SwUpdateStore to use NotificationStore instead of MatSnackBar;\n  remove snackbar-specific state fields (message/action/snackbarConfig)\n- Add lib-notification-bell to MainToolbar\n- Provide NotificationStore alongside SwUpdateStore in app.ts\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(shared): add unit tests for NotificationBell and NotificationList\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): anchor overlay to button element; add min-height to empty panel\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): use click event target as overlay anchor\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(main-toolbar): move notification bell to far right, after nav links\n\nBell is now rightmost item (logged out) or second from right next to\nlogout (logged in), matching Facebook/LinkedIn pattern. This also\nfixes overlay positioning since the bell is now at the viewport edge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): use global position strategy anchored to top-right\n\nDrops the flexibleConnectedTo approach entirely. Panel is now fixed at\nright:8px top:72px (below the toolbar), matching Facebook/LinkedIn style.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): widen panel to 380px and fix overlay top offset for 56px toolbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): make host display:block so w-full fills overlay pane\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-bell): flush top to 56px toolbar, right to 16px to clear scrollbar\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(styles): add scrollbar-gutter:stable to prevent layout shift on scroll\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(styles): move scrollbar-gutter:stable to main scroll container, not html\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: remove scrollbar-gutter:stable, causes unwanted gap on non-scrolling pages\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(debug): add secret /debug page with notification test buttons\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): fix unread border and min-height\n\n- Use [class.border-l-4] + [class.border-l-blue-500] so border fully\n  disappears on mark-read (border-neutral-100 was overriding border-l-transparent)\n- Move min-h off container onto empty state only\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(notification-list): restore unread dot indicator next to title\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(dx): add reload action to debug sw-update notification\n\nMirrors the real sw-update store action so the debug page accurately\nrepresents the notification UX — shows the Reload button and triggers\nwindow.location.reload() when clicked.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: remove NavigationEnd polling from SwUpdateStore\n\nPolling checkForUpdate() on every NavigationEnd risked adding a new\nsw-update notification on each navigation while an update was pending.\nThe Angular SW checks for updates automatically on load and via its own\ninternal schedule — manual polling is unnecessary.\n\nRemoves: checkForUpdate rxMethod, Router dependency, related tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chrisjwalk <8442112+chrisjwalk@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptu9uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI6UQABd5Q0o4fPbGSuRieFVfld8e\nzn73vhadmk4QAkSH9HtQbvQc3UD0tjicy9IvuAX0c3arv4G6qvp8JSr3ZtZ9m9gt\nn5fWs8R9W38MhbLtsBkXr/GHxdoJTo4YF9oODqGfzK4MbAZhlEX+fU6NHclc5i94\njUqRXSDA75iHHwMgi3xJDPn4bJzLtBQOQziCZwxc+qg6LMwdYVPJGnfZCa+cbPRj\n6IZeN9Znr0vwVGesN1hjx+bLtO3U3AG7rqPfVIweloXNFYyBZktSfcaeZutYuZOt\nSnVjwlg6ieu/tpqHUSaSRD1JJOQDlvAes+7/6cfAbOObYxft/ua9QJ47SVcqxhup\nkmRdcZs1lgvArkVHtMrppw0DbmV/jcr04Z0DDnz84wZ05t5JhIMRl8IewXQsuWZg\nYYRd3TcRjtcM26JJHOpvKTJ493BZLe+huBLSm8t5WWSuPJOHa4ConIXaYH6LXxtQ\nLpRH/DYY62K466hpYotww3lNZNp6Fujl+ZpijPWThOG5USpBv3+q86q/OWDQxJg/\nHqNBO8RU17hRJJ1Wyb5P7YK6h5UOznH94iK1b1u5pHqzlP0n7kxeYM6IOIT/1+qJ\nqMrwtS0h55NPsD1VHF4++qvSyvuvD023nVVEwMtxGKZkijlCF15F7j54poI13gH+\nab0+0nwEsbA1iWiWHF++\n=YDY1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-15T17:42:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"