e":"fix: check for SW updates on NavigationEnd and add reload test (closes #59)\n\n- Removed interval-based polling (snackbar can fire while user is away)\n- Added checkForUpdate() call on each NavigationEnd via Router.events so\n  the prompt only appears while the user is actively navigating\n- Injected DOCUMENT token instead of document global for testability\n- Added test for activateUpdate on snackbar action\n- Added tests for NavigationEnd-triggered checkForUpdate\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ec871f6cb66f8915e2a41e298a7cf676278bcbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/6ec871f6cb66f8915e2a41e298a7cf676278bcbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/992feaa6e38958c8fdde6067475b32bf73f0b750","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisjwalk-bot","id":268224883,"login":"chrisjwalk-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD_zJcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":