ot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T21:12:48Z","email":"268224883+chrisjwalk-bot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chrisjwalk-bot"},"message":"fix: use setupTestBed() for proper Vitest TestBed reset and remove lodash\n\nThe custom initTestEnvironment() call in test-setup.shared.ts was missing\nthe beforeEach/afterEach cleanup hooks (ɵgetCleanupHook) that Angular\nrequires to reset TestBed between tests when running under Vitest.\nWithout these hooks, the first test in each file would instantiate TestBed\nand all subsequent tests would fail with ''Cannot configure the test module\nwhen the test module has already been instantiated''.\n\nSwitch to setupTestBed({ zoneless: true }) from\n@analogjs/vitest-angular/setup-testbed which registers the correct\nVitest-native lifecycle hooks via getCleanupHook().\n\nAlso remove lodash import from weather-forecast.store.ts — lodash was\nremoved in #39 but this branch''s version still referenced it. Replace\nisEqual() with JSON.stringify comparison and isNil() with == null checks,\nmatching the approach used in main.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"88ac17cc896eca62a590ddd8790021883e66b2d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/trees/88ac17cc896eca62a590ddd8790021883e66b2d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisjwalk/angular-cli-netcore-ngrx-starter/git/commits/01d04ccb9f63a68af9314ae892af204e87c0ff2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268224883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisjwalk-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","h