"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/commits/47d6145ddcdb07fcc1dcea9c163cde94e070bf24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T15:11:42Z","email":"5370675+sarahdayan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarah Dayan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T15:11:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(api): throw when converting between currencies with different bases (#832)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `convert()` function now throws when the source and target\ncurrencies have different bases (e.g., USD base 10 → MGA base 5),\ninstead of silently producing wrong results.\n\nWe can revisit supporting this if this becomes a real need.\n\nFixes #477\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f59d861dd4f9f9e92c93c88535644dfdffe6993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/trees/5f59d861dd4f9f9e92c93c88535644dfdffe6993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/commits/47d6145ddcdb07fcc1dcea9c163cde94e070bf24","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f59d861dd4f9f9e92c93c88535644dfdffe6993\nparent ab5d4a3245fc496b6d29e0fdfe2e628d8be1e3c7\nauthor Sarah Dayan <5370675+sarahdayan@users.noreply.github.com> 1772291502 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772291502 +0100\n\nfix(api): throw when converting between currencies with different bases (#832)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `convert()` function now throws when the source and target\ncurrencies have different bases (e.g., USD base 10 → MGA base 5),\ninstead of silently producing wrong results.\n\nWe can revisit supporting this if this becomes a real need.\n\nFixes #477\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpowWuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbV8QAJowqDidvuLxlDFSReC27Jyh\nMgvswGzQRJ0ADuOUA7xbZFiwpizBTBhCzQ4OIoX50XLyuLmW1hWr8facB6zT10YJ\nLBasJliq4/V2SmtG+Y8Znk0Hvq/Mv