n- Add README and docs entry for the example\n- Deploy the example on Vercel at\n`v2.dinerojs.com/examples/expense-splitter/`\n- Rename \"Sandboxes\" to \"Demos\" across the docs site\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Run `npm run build -w @dinero.js/example-expense-splitter` and\nverify it builds\n- [ ] Run `npm run dev -w @dinero.js/example-expense-splitter` and\nverify the app works locally\n- [ ] Verify the base path (`/examples/expense-splitter/`) is reflected\nin the built assets\n- [ ] Verify the docs site builds with `npm run docs:build`\n- [ ] Verify `/sandboxes` redirects to `/demos`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04e5668d53fa444e6f056108436f273435a47939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/trees/04e5668d53fa444e6f056108436f273435a47939"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/commits/ad046d0ac9a700215f1b9c3ccab698fa479bc417","verification":{"payload":"tree 04e5668d53fa444e6f056108436f273435a47939\nparent 834891832985fdbefc89124f455bc465a91f9d27\nauthor Sarah Dayan <5370675+sarahdayan@users.noreply.github.com> 1770503384 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770503384 +0100\n\ndocs(examples): add expense splitter README, demo, and docs (#827)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a full-featured expense splitter example (React + Vite + Tailwind)\ndemonstrating `allocate()`, balance tracking, and optimal debt\nsettlement\n- Add README and docs entry for the example\n- Deploy the example on Vercel at\n`v2.dinerojs.com/examples/expense-splitter/`\n- Rename \"Sandboxes\" to \"Demos\" across the docs site\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Run `npm run build -w @dinero.js/example-expense-splitter` and\nverify it builds\n- [ ] Run `npm run dev -w @dinero.js/example-expense-splitter` and\nverify the app works locally\n- [ ] Verify the base path (`/examples/expense-splitter/`) is reflected\nin the built assets\n- [ ] Verify the docs site builds with `npm run docs:build`\n- [ ] Verify `/sandb