api.github.com/users/sarahdayan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahdayan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahdayan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahdayan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/commits/4486cb3edce0356d5bc1d1517eca95986ef78528/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T16:40:49Z","email":"5370675+sarahdayan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarah Dayan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T16:40:49Z","email":"5370675+sarahdayan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarah Dayan"},"message":"refactor(core): add Dinero* prefix to all public types\n\nRenamed all public types to use the Dinero* prefix for consistency and to\navoid naming conflicts with user code:\n\n- Calculator → DineroCalculator\n- Currency → DineroCurrency\n- ComparisonOperator → DineroComparisonOperator\n- BinaryOperation → DineroBinaryOperation\n- UnaryOperation → DineroUnaryOperation\n- DivideOperation → DineroDivideOperation\n- Formatter → DineroFormatter\n- Rates → DineroRates\n- ScaledAmount → DineroScaledAmount\n- Transformer → DineroTransformer\n\nTypes already prefixed remain unchanged: Dinero, DineroFactory, DineroOptions,\nDineroSnapshot.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All type imports must use new names (e.g., DineroCalculator\ninstead of Calculator).\n\nFixes SAR-117\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33db1fc26f7ad744f16267bf8ce639d0546d48f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/trees/33db1fc26f7ad744f16267bf8ce639d0546d48f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dinerojs/dinero.js/git/commits/4486cb3edce0356d5bc1d1517eca95986ef78528","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5370675?v=4","events_url":"https://