ui@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Hirasawa_Yui"},"message":"Add RTK CLI instructions and pretool hook\n\nIntroduce RTK (token-optimized CLI) guidance for contributors via .github/copilot-instructions.md, documenting the requirement to prefix shell commands with `rtk` and listing meta commands for usage and diagnostics. Add a hook configuration .github/hooks/rtk-rewrite.json that runs `rtk hook copilot` on PreToolUse to integrate the RTK proxy with tooling and track usage.","tree":{"sha":"107e49211598cc2dc74f6cab19752e5820f945cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CyberYui/hello-Github/git/trees/107e49211598cc2dc74f6cab19752e5820f945cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CyberYui/hello-Github/git/commits/9908f146466cc783f97f5b234b2fef67336d9dc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30543689?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CyberYui","id":30543689,"login":"CyberYui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTQzNjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CyberYui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CyberYui/hello-Github/commit/9908f146466cc783f97f5b234b2fef67336d9dc3","node_id":"C_kwDOB3D-htoAKDk5MDhmMTQ2NDY2Y2M3ODNmOTdmNWIyMzRiMmZlZjY3MzM2ZDlkYzM","pa